&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the creative transformation company. We use the power of creativity to build better futures for our people, planet, clients and communities. For more information, visit wpp.com.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP’s global media collective. In a world where media is everywhere and in everything, we bring the best platform, people, and partners together to create limitless opportunities for growth. For more information, visit wppmedia.com&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About EssenceMediacom: A Leading WPP Media Brand&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;EssenceMediacom&amp;nbsp;is a new breed of media agency. Grounded in analytics &amp;amp; insights and powered by data &amp;amp; technology, we believe in the power of media and creative to drive breakthroughs for the world’s best brands. We help clients understand the modern marketing paradox and discover the breakthroughs brands need to win with their consumers. We are designed for the new communications economy — built on data &amp;amp; technology, built for people &amp;amp; algorithms, built around diverse schools of thought, built to test &amp;amp; learn at scale, and, crucially, built to evolve.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary and Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a quick thinking, enthusiastic &lt;strong&gt;SEO Senior Executive&lt;/strong&gt; to support the account managers with the delivery of the day-to-day account for &lt;strong&gt;Honda Motor Company.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be responsible for supporting account managers delivering best in class SEO/GEO solutions to our clients, as well as ensuring the best outputs, working alongside other members of the team. We are looking for someone who is enthusiastic, eager to learn and be an excellent team player.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills and Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At WPP Media, we believe in the power of our culture and our people. It’s what elevates us to deliver exceptional experiences for both our clients and each other. In this role it will be critical to embrace WPP &amp;amp; WPP Media’s shared core values:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be &lt;strong&gt;Extraordinary&lt;/strong&gt; by &lt;em&gt;Leading Collectively&lt;/em&gt; to &lt;em&gt;Inspire transformational Creativity.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create an &lt;strong&gt;Open&lt;/strong&gt; environment by&lt;em&gt; Balancing People and Client Experiences&lt;/em&gt; by &lt;em&gt;Cultivating Trust&lt;/em&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead &lt;strong&gt;Optimistically&lt;/strong&gt; by &lt;em&gt;Championing Growth&lt;/em&gt; &lt;em&gt;and Development&lt;/em&gt; to &lt;em&gt;Mobilize the Enterprise&lt;/em&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role specific:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Support SEO Account Managers and wider team by conducting and writing up:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keyword research&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;On-page optimisation advice&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical audits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitor analysis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reporting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of modern search and Large language models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tracking, monitoring and reporting using Google Analytics and other tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee the performance of all SEO campaigns and ensure that key insights are incorporated into future activity (monitor and report KPIs and technical issues across all clients’ websites)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor industry trends and updates and report back on insights to their Account Manager and the wider team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Essential personal qualities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High standard of written and spoken English – second language desire for EMEA&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;International SEO experience is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good knowledge of Excel&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to juggle several tasks at once and consistently to deliver high-quality work to a timescale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A high degree of numeracy and literacy are essential (analytical thinking)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to use SEO tools efficiently and provide insights, including Google Analytics, Advanced Web Rankings, Lumar, SEMRUSH&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to pre-empt problems and be proactive in producing solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at WPP Media &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our passion for shaping the next era of media includes investing in our employees to help them do their best work, and we’re just as committed to employee growth as we are to responsible media investment. WPP Media employees can tap into the global WPP Media &amp;amp; WPP networks to pursue their passions, grow their networks, and learn at the cutting edge of marketing and advertising. We have a variety of employee resource groups and host frequent in-office events showcasing team wins, sharing thought leadership, and celebrating holidays and milestone events. Our benefits include competitive medical, group retirement plans, vision, and dental insurance, significant paid time off, preferential partner discounts, and employee mental health awareness days.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to particular characteristics. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Please note this is a UK based role and requires individuals to have the right to work in this location&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please read our Privacy Notice (&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy)&lt;/a&gt; for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2644 - Regional Director, Digital&amp;nbsp; - GCS&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary and Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Team Honda is on a transformative journey with Honda Motor Europe to aid data-driven decisioning, prove marketing effectiveness and drive incremental order growth for its four divisions – Automobiles, Motorcycles, Marine and Power Products.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To bring this vision to life, Honda has embarked on a deep strategic partnership with WPP. &amp;nbsp;We are building a bespoke, integrated agency model focused on one clear ambition: to drive desire for Honda products, grow consideration and increase order intake.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At the heart of this collaboration is WPP Open, our intelligent marketing operating system. WPP Open blends WPP&#39;s world-class creative and media talent with cutting-edge AI and technology to create hyper-personalised, immersive brand experiences. Our role is to connect with customers at every touchpoint, from global brand campaigns to individual customer journeys. By integrating media, strategy, data, and technology, we will maximise efficiency and effectiveness, accelerating growth for the entire Honda portfolio.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Team Honda is seeking a &lt;strong&gt;Regional Digital Director&lt;/strong&gt; to lead the digital and in-platform advancement of our global digital activity.&amp;nbsp; The role is responsible for ensuring that our activation operations map to the strategic directions of Honda Motor Europe (HME) and support the ambitions of transparent, sustainable, data-driven decisioning.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reporting to the Global Client Lead, the successful candidate will work with WPP Media specialist teams across a variety of strategic programs designed to ensure performance excellence in the markets of Automobiles, Motorbikes, Marine and Power Products.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role requires a strategic and execution-focused leader with deep expertise in biddable media and data-driven marketing, ideally as these pertain to driving orders for Automobiles, Motorbikes, Marine and Power Products.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The role will include supporting on HME operational frameworks including digital brand safety and suitability, audience targeting frameworks and digital data collection.&amp;nbsp; The role will also extend into data-driven programs, focusing on the successful deployment and update of data solutions feeding in-platform execution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills and Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At WPP Media, we believe in the power of culture and our people.&amp;nbsp; It’s what elevates us to deliver exceptional experiences for both our clients and each other.&amp;nbsp; In this role, it will be critical to embrace WPP &amp;amp; WPP Media’s shared core values:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Be &lt;strong&gt;extraordinary&lt;/strong&gt; by leading collectively to inspire transformational creativity&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Create an &lt;strong&gt;open&lt;/strong&gt; environment by balancing people and client experiences by cultivating trust&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lead with &lt;strong&gt;optimism&lt;/strong&gt; by championing growth, learning and development to mobilize the enterprise.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ideal candidate will have a strong background in digital media operations for planning and execution, proven leadership experience and the ability to collaborate across markets, platforms, internal and external stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience in biddable media operations and execution within a large-scale organisation or agency environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven leadership experience in managing teams and driving digital transformation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong expertise in data-driven marketing and the integration of 1PD data sets into digital platforms and digital audience targeting technology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with brand safety and verification platform partners, their commercial model and the impact on to media platform decisioning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of channel maturity models, test-and-learn and incrementality frameworks and digital media best practises.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and problem-solving skills with the ability to translate insights into strategic action.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience working with the biddable platforms themselves towards gaining HME a competitive advantage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience and familiarity with Ad Operations processes to ensure best practise processes are in place for digital media execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at WPP Media &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our passion for shaping the next era of media is powered by our commitment to&amp;nbsp;Be Extraordinary, investing in our employees to inspire transformational creativity. We also&amp;nbsp;Lead Optimistically,&amp;nbsp;firmly believing&amp;nbsp;in and&amp;nbsp;Championing Growth and Development&amp;nbsp;for every individual. This commitment allows WPP Media employees to&amp;nbsp;leverage&amp;nbsp;the extensive global WPP Media &amp;amp; WPP networks to pursue their passions, build vital professional connections, and learn at the&amp;nbsp;cutting edge&amp;nbsp;of marketing and advertising.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&amp;nbsp;Create an Open environment&amp;nbsp;built on trust and respect, where everyone feels they belong and has opportunities to progress. This inclusive culture is fostered through a variety of employee resource groups and frequent in-office events&amp;nbsp;showcasing&amp;nbsp;team wins, sharing thought leadership, and celebrating holidays and milestone events. Our comprehensive benefits package reflects this commitment, including competitive medical, group retirement plans, vision, and dental insurance, significant paid time off, preferential partner discounts, and employee mental health awareness days.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to characteristics. We believe the best work happens when&amp;nbsp;we&#39;re&amp;nbsp;together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection in this open and supportive environment.&amp;nbsp;That&#39;s&amp;nbsp;why&amp;nbsp;we’ve&amp;nbsp;adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you&amp;nbsp;require&amp;nbsp;accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&amp;nbsp; Please note that while our philosophy is the same across WPP, benefits may vary by office/country.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please note this is a UK based role and requires individuals to have the right to work in this location&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please read our Privacy Notice (&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy)&lt;/a&gt; for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While we appreciate all applications received, only those candidates selected for an interview will be contacted.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Promoted&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3374 - Director, Client Services - UK&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary and Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Business Directors support the Client Director in the leadership of an account and the campaign delivery process and is a focal point of contact for senior clients. With previous proven and demonstrable experience and success at atleast an Account Director level, success in this role is measured through the lens of: best in class work, a delighted client, happy and motivated internal teams, profitable revenue for the agency, and account growth. Business Directors will use their developed leadership skills to lead and develop their teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Google via WPP Made For Google - A little about us&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Made For Google (MFG) is a bespoke media team for Google. We are made up of best in class digital, offline, and integrated media experts who work together to enhance media’s contribution to Google’s business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are a united, diverse team driven by a spirit of curiosity. Committed to pioneering solutions that surpass industry standards, we aim to drive excellence, support a fulfilled team, and exceed expectations while fostering growth and positive impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Client Services team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;The Client Services team is responsible for creating the conditions by which our clients love our work. We do this by building trust and exerting influence through deeper, more strategic relationships with our clients, and by driving, leading and owning the campaign delivery process. We also foster a culture of support and encouragement internally.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Essential Functions/Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Client Satisfaction&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Point of contact for clients ensuring client satisfaction is maintained throughout the campaign lifecycle and beyond&lt;br&gt;- Develops and maintains a working-level understanding of assigned client’s industries, company culture, and products/services&lt;br&gt;- Supports the wider team in delivering an exceptional client experience during every agency interaction&lt;br&gt;- Seeks opportunities to delight clients and strives to elevate all client relationships to trusted partner status&lt;br&gt;- Ensures client expectations across the account are clear and defined, including frequency of status updates and milestone reviews&lt;br&gt;- Assists in managing total client satisfaction, identifying any issues or barriers and escalating as necessary&lt;br&gt;- Responsible for the Deliverables Register ensuring all required individual deliverable scores are recorded and communicated accordingly&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Team Happiness&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Ensures that the wider team feel invested in, engaged with, cared for and are motivated to deliver their best work&lt;br&gt;- Provides timely and actionable feedback to the team to aid in their development&lt;br&gt;- Ensures the fun and support is brought into the day-to-day life on the account&lt;br&gt;- Proactively contributes to the Essence culture including mentorship to individuals both inside and outside their team&lt;br&gt;- Provide awareness and recognition for jobs well done&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Work Quality and Innovation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Engages with clients to define Actionable Briefs for tier 1 campaigns whilst maintaining oversight of the Actionable Briefs for tier 2 and tier 3 campaigns.&lt;br&gt;- Interrogates the work and client deliverables on tier 1 briefs on behalf of the client to ensure they exceed expectations.&lt;br&gt;- Provides campaign and project management leadership during the campaign lifecycle to ensure on time and on brief delivery of client work&lt;br&gt;- Fosters collaboration with the Practices to ensure best in class work and ongoing innovation is delivered across the client business&lt;br&gt;- Proactively anticipates and identifies potential risks, issues and opportunities, across all briefs and processes escalating to Practice Lead and CS leadership where necessary. - Leads daily huddles and weekly client status meeting, casting the right team as appropriate&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Financial Strength and Operational Excellence&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Providing accurate forecast figures on a monthly, quarterly and yearly basis, working closely with CFO to ensure “no surprises&lt;br&gt;- Able to help manage client budgets against objectives set with rest of account team&lt;br&gt;- Solicits regular feedback from clients to ensure operational excellence and seeks continued improvements on work quality&lt;br&gt;- Calculate the workload implication of new campaigns and feed into resource management.&lt;br&gt;Growth and Diversity of Clients&lt;br&gt;- Nurtures organic growth opportunities across existing clients through their in depth knowledge and understanding of the business needs and challenges of their client&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills and Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- Strong written and verbal communication skills across all platforms&lt;br&gt;- Strong organizational skills, great attention to detail and ability to Q/A work&lt;br&gt;- Solid grasp of all areas of digital marketing, including a deep knowledge of digital media&lt;br&gt;- Ability to adhere to and meet deadlines and project manage multiple campaigns&lt;br&gt;- Superb client relationship and management skills&lt;br&gt;- Proven problem solving skills and ability to think outside of the box for creative solutions&lt;br&gt;- Ability to work independently and collaborate in a team environment&lt;br&gt;- Detail oriented and responsive, deadline-driven with strong quantitative reasoning skills&lt;br&gt;- Strong financial management skills, demonstrating an ability to manage campaigns to budget and margin forecasts and identify financial risks&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Supervisory Responsibility:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Potential to line manage 1-3 direct report, supporting their career growth and development within Client Services&lt;br&gt;- Lead by example while motivating and coaching juniors on the team&lt;br&gt;- Foster an environment for transparency and open communication&lt;br&gt;- Taking ownership and directing others as needed within account team, with a key focus on delegation to ensure space to work on broader workstreams&lt;br&gt;- Responsible for wider team set up and organogram&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Education and Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Degree educated or equivalent professional experience&lt;br&gt;- Proven and demonstrable experience at a Account Director+ role in media agency&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at WPP Media &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our passion for shaping the next era of media includes investing in our employees to help them do their best work, and we’re just as committed to employee growth as we are to responsible media investment. WPP Media employees can tap into the global WPP Media &amp;amp; WPP networks to pursue their passions, grow their networks, and learn at the cutting edge of marketing and advertising. We have a variety of employee resource groups and host frequent in-office events showcasing team wins, sharing thought leadership, and celebrating holidays and milestone events. Our benefits include competitive medical, group retirement plans, vision, and dental insurance, significant paid time off, preferential partner discounts, and employee mental health awareness days. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to particular characteristics. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please note this is a UK based role and requires individuals to have the right to work in this location&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please read our Privacy Notice (https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy) for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Promoted&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2102 - Data Strategy Manager - UK&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Role&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Summary and Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;EssenceMediacom is a new breed of media agency. Grounded in analytics &amp;amp; insights and powered by data &amp;amp; technology, we believe in the power of media and creative to drive breakthroughs for the world’s best brands. We help clients understand the modern marketing paradox and discover the breakthroughs brands need to win with their consumers. We are designed for the new communications economy — built on data &amp;amp; technology, built for people &amp;amp; algorithms, built around diverse schools of thought, built to test &amp;amp; learn at scale, and, crucially, built to evolve.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Strategy Manager - UK&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;EssenceMediacom is seeking a Data Strategy Manager to join our growing Data, Technology &amp;amp; Analytics team, reporting into the Data, Tech &amp;amp; Analytics Lead. The team focuses on maximising the value and impact of all data types on a client’s business, and how we effectively measure the performance to help make brands become more valuable to the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be working with one of the leading retailers in the UK, Boots, to harness their data and improve the performance of their campaigns, developing and deploying media measurement solutions. Communication with client stakeholders and effective management of assigned tasks is critical in this role. You will be joining a team which has doubled in resource over the past 12 months, with an ever-expanding remit to put data at the heart of the marketing function.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Part of The Boots Group, Boots is the UKs authority in beauty, wellness and healthcare with 176 years of trusted heritage and innovation behind it. Boots consistently delivers strong retail and pharmacy sales quarter after quarter in a hugely competitive market.&amp;nbsp; Boots are hungry to keep striving and prioritise great teamwork and true partnership with their agencies to achieve their ambitions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;They are a client who embrace change, encourage innovation, are leaders in data-led planning to fully understand the impact of media in the wider business system and always make time to appreciate achievements and say thank you.&amp;nbsp; They challenge us to deliver world class media planning and activation and enjoy getting recognition for great work we achieve together.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have invested in giving you the tools to make you as successful as possible, including training/development, full access to relevant tools/platforms and a wider global community of analysts and data scientists.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary &amp;amp; Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Responsible for transforming data into actionable insights that drive superior client outcomes. Data Strategy involves transforming the way our clients think about, organize and orchestrate data &amp;amp; technology to deliver more timely, engaging and meaningful brand experience for their customers. Boots is a data rich client and that combined with clients willingness to test and evolve makes for opportunities to do great work. The Project Lead will optimise audience-driven strategies, identify growth opportunities, and deliver measurable business impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills and Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Data-led audience &amp;amp; bidding strategy and enablement;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Using the data-sets and technology available to Boots, understand the audiences and support in the delivery of test, trial and strategy recommendations across paid media campaigns on addressable channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with internal teams, Boots clients and partner teams to define, justify and request future signals and data products which can drive the clients business goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strategic Project Ownership;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You won’t be just doing campaign based work and will play a significant role in defining the strategic work-streams that will have the most business impact for Boots. Two key examples here are;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data Partnerships: oversee strategic partnerships, ensuring their data is fully integrated and leveraged within our platforms to deliver maximum value for the client.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Agentic AI: guiding the wider DTA team on what personas and agents need to be built to deliver valuable insights for the clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Cross-functional Collaboration;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with stakeholders to identify and deliver on technology opportunities that drive growth and optimise outcomes for the clients business. This includes our internal MarTech team and the CRM team at Boots&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foster collaboration between technical and non-technical teams, ensuring alignment on project goals and client objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Co-own Boots Data Strategy testing workstream;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with internal testing leads and activation teams to bring forward robust testing methodologies for Data &amp;amp; Tech focused tests.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Produce collateral for client facing case studies and share more widely with the business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Data Governance and Compliance&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Boots, being a Pharmacy (and so have sensitive data sets), is a privacy first advertiser. As a result, they have a process for utilizing new partners on plans - you will be owning this process to ensure any new partners on plan have the correct Boots and WPP approvals before use.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Updating any partner changes and reflecting this in internal documents and with client.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;A bit about yourself:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep interest in Media &amp;amp; Technology: An understanding of and desire to learn more about data products, technology, and trends within the advertising and marketing industry with the ability to articulate complex technical concepts to both technical and non-technical stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customer Focus: A relentless focus on client success, with a passion for delivering exceptional client experiences and driving long-term relationships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communication Skills: Exceptional communication and relationship-building skills, as this role hinges on effective interaction with clients and agency partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing multiple stakeholders in a matrixed environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Digital working agency-side working on a data-led role within Data &amp;amp; Tech or Activation, with a strong emphasis on audience-based buying, audience data management and segmentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly developed interpersonal, team building and relationship management skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills and a natural affinity for numbers is key; You must be able to analyse raw data, draw conclusions and develop actionable recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of the importance of privacy first media and what that means for how we need to do things differently&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at WPP Media &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our passion for shaping the next era of media is powered by our commitment to&amp;nbsp;Be Extraordinary, investing in our employees to inspire transformational creativity. We also&amp;nbsp;Lead Optimistically,&amp;nbsp;firmly believing&amp;nbsp;in and&amp;nbsp;Championing Growth and Development&amp;nbsp;for every individual. This commitment allows WPP Media employees to&amp;nbsp;leverage&amp;nbsp;the extensive global WPP Media &amp;amp; WPP networks to pursue their passions, build vital professional connections, and learn at the&amp;nbsp;cutting edge&amp;nbsp;of marketing and advertising.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&amp;nbsp;Create an Open environment&amp;nbsp;built on trust and respect, where everyone feels they belong and has opportunities to progress. This inclusive culture is fostered through a variety of employee resource groups and frequent in-office events&amp;nbsp;showcasing&amp;nbsp;team wins, sharing thought leadership, and celebrating holidays and milestone events. Our comprehensive benefits package reflects this commitment, including competitive medical, group retirement plans, vision, and dental insurance, significant paid time off, preferential partner discounts, and employee mental health awareness days.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to characteristics. We believe the best work happens when&amp;nbsp;we&#39;re&amp;nbsp;together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection in this open and supportive environment.&amp;nbsp;That&#39;s&amp;nbsp;why&amp;nbsp;we’ve&amp;nbsp;adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you&amp;nbsp;require&amp;nbsp;accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Please note this is a UK based role and requires individuals to have the right to work in this location&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please read our Privacy Notice (&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy)&lt;/a&gt; for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While we appreciate all applications received, only those candidates selected for an interview will be contacted.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Promoted&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3512 - Associate Director, Programme Management - Global&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary and Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Associate Director of Programme Management will work closely with the Programme Leads and wider project team to deliver, maintain, and drive adoption in the business of a portfolio of solutions that provide our agencies with advantage through access to internal business data intelligence via application of best-in-class systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;With the Programme Leads and the Head of Global Business systems, develop a program of works for existing and new systems that supports WPP Media’s goals and best practices for maintenance internal business data on their clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate project requirements into tangible deliverables and solutions with a key focus on the cost and time to deliver.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own project planning required to deliver the programme objectives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to solution design in a thoughtful and user centric manner: How will end users engage and get best value from the products of the programme?&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work directly with all project contributors - from external vendors, internal team members to all stakeholders to allocate and prioritize this wider team’s workload to reach business goals and to incrementally deliver value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuously prioritize the backlog to ensure that the team are focusing on the most impactful areas first.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define goals, timelines, and potential risks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain clear project plans and monitor progress against them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Testing to ensure that the product functions correctly and meets quality standards in the deployed state.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist in implementation the product including onboarding of new users and migration of data. This may involve managing updates or new features gradually to minimize disruption and ensure a smooth transition.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Change management. Programme management does not end with technical implementation. Delivery of the change and adoption throughout the business both at launch but also through an ongoing programme of works is the Director of Programme Management’s responsibility&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure that users are fully enabled and trained ready to drive quality outcomes including designing supporting materials, user guides and online demonstrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gather feedback from users and stakeholders to identify areas for improvement for future deployments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Derive actionable insights from usage metrics that can be used to inform improvements in our products and processes in the service of driving product greater adoption in the practitioner user base.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist in the development of reporting solutions to democratise the data, captured in our applications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the overall vision, product goals, roadmaps, and backlog for the products in your portfolio.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;System Testing &amp;amp; Migration:&lt;/strong&gt; Getting hands-on with the products, participating in user acceptance testing (UAT) for new feature releases, and assisting with data migration where required-&lt;strong&gt; replace with&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;System Expertise&lt;/strong&gt;: Getting hands on with the products, supporting the product leads during all product lifecycle stages&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Measures of Success&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Undertake a full audit of the projects in scope core to the program’s 2026 objectives and achieve full knowledge transfer making a tangible impact on product delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish meaningful relationships with business owners to support future change requests and features required as part of the transformation required in client teams for successful implantation of the product.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Produce a plan with clear tasks required to deliver the core system out to the target launch markets and manage the delivery of those tasks to successful completion&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop, in consultation with the product owner a staged approach to deliver the core projects as a master program plan, complete with priorities and resource requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills and Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience of working with internal business teams, managing core in-house project teams and external suppliers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience in a platform, product or technology service deployment and enablement role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of the product development lifecycle and change management methodologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to communicate with and understand cross-functional, highly matrixed, multi-geographical teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly effective communication and interpersonal abilities, with a focus on collaboration, consensus, and relationship building.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional resourcefulness and quick, practical thinking in a demanding environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong and flexible work ethic; able to work under pressure and juggle multiple responsibilities to meet deadlines and deliver results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in project management software such as Asana, Wrike, Jira/Confluence, Azure DevOps&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiar with agile methodologies (Scrum, Kanban) to deliver technical products and data solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in Ai tools and processes including Machine Learning and Gen AI&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working Knowledge of Power BI or similar reporting solutions software would be an advantage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in project/change management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An excellent communicator with highly developed stakeholder management and influencing skills. You apply these across a broad range of roles from C-suite and ExCo level sponsors to product owners and development team members.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An excellent listener who can balance multiple perspectives on opportunities, challenges and requirements and translate into action.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly analytical and data-driven&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A “can-do” attitude to achieve objectives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Motivated, self-starter, self-reliant, resilient, and ambitious&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Life at WPP Media &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Our passion for shaping the next era of media is powered by our commitment to&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Be Extraordinary, investing in our employees to inspire transformational creativity. We also&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Lead Optimistically, firmly believing in and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Championing Growth and Development&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;for every individual. This commitment allows WPP Media employees to leverage the extensive global WPP Media &amp;amp; WPP networks to pursue their passions, build vital professional connections, and learn at the cutting edge of marketing and advertising.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;We&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Create an Open environment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;built on trust and respect, where everyone feels they belong and has opportunities to progress. This inclusive culture is fostered through a variety of employee resource groups and frequent in-office events showcasing team wins, sharing thought leadership, and celebrating holidays and milestone events. Our comprehensive benefits package reflects this commitment, including competitive medical, group retirement plans, vision, and dental insurance, significant paid time off, preferential partner discounts, and employee mental health awareness days.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;WPP Media is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to characteristics. We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection in this open and supportive environment. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;  Please note that while our philosophy is the same across WPP, benefits may vary by office/country.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Please note this is a UK based role and requires individuals to have the right to work in this location&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Please read our Privacy Notice (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;While we appreciate all applications received, only those candidates selected for an interview will be contacted.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
