&lt;p&gt;Vous avez une réelle expérience de la prospection à froid, sur le terrain ou par téléphone ? Rejoignez SumUp et accompagnez les commerçants avec des solutions de paiement simples et reconnues.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vos missions&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prospecter les cafés, restaurants, boutiques, salons et entreprises de votre secteur ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identifier leurs besoins, présenter la solution adaptée et réaliser des démonstrations ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Accompagner les commerçants jusqu’à l’activation et développer votre portefeuille.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;La prospection est réalisée par vos soins : aucun portefeuille de leads n’est fourni.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Votre rémunération&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Cette activité est rémunérée exclusivement à la commission, sans salaire fixe ni revenu minimum garanti. La rémunération dépend notamment des produits vendus, de l’activation des commerçants, du volume d’activité généré et du maintien de cette activité dans le temps.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;La prospection est réalisée par vos soins : aucun portefeuille de leads n’est fourni.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vos outils et votre organisation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SumUp fournit une formation initiale, un terminal de démonstration et des supports commerciaux. Un référent de secteur reste disponible pour vous accompagner.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Votre zone est définie pendant le recrutement selon votre localisation et les secteurs ouverts. Vous organisez librement votre activité. Vos déplacements et les frais associés restent à votre charge ; aucun véhicule de fonction n’est fourni.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Votre profil&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Au moins un an d’expérience en prospection à froid, terrain ou téléphonique, au cours des six dernières années ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;À l’aise dans une démarche commerciale proactive auprès de professionnels ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Autonome, persévérant(e), fiable et orienté(e) résultats ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Disponible au moins trois jours par semaine ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Numéro SIRET valide au démarrage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Processus de recrutement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Échange téléphonique avec notre équipe recrutement ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Entretien avec le ou la référente de votre secteur ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Décision rapide fondée sur votre expérience et votre motivation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Envie de développer votre activité avec une rémunération sans plafond et des revenus récurrents potentiels ? &lt;strong&gt;Postulez dès maintenant !&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Application Tip&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We recognise that candidates feel they need to meet 100% of the job criteria in order to apply for a job. Please note that this is only a guide. If you don’t tick every box, it’s ok too because it means you have room to learn and develop your career at SumUp.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;color: #e03e2d;&quot;&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; France&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;color: #e03e2d;&quot;&gt;We Are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;RTB House is a next-generation performance demand-side platform (DSP) that uses proprietary Deep Learning AI algorithms to help brands grow. The company is the market leader in driving performance using Deep Learning across the entire purchase funnel.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Founded in 2012 and now operating in 90+ markets, RTB House has always been private-by-design. It embraces first-party advertising and a relentless approach to innovation. RTB House offers end-to-end Deep Learning-powered AdTech products and solutions to maximize conversion, drive new customer acquisition, create engagement, and fuel long-term demand for a global base of clients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In 2026, RTB House launched rtb.com, a self-service platform specifically designed to allow small and medium-sized businesses and agencies to deploy auto-built creatives and maximize performance on any budget.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;color: #e03e2d;&quot;&gt;You Will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct the technical operations for our clients;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordination of all technical issues with regards to online campaign launching and running process;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support technical integration between rtb.com and client’s e-commerce platform;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with sales teams to deliver high standards of customer service;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor and analyze the effectiveness of online campaigns;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Propose optimization solutions for processes in order to achieve both internal and external goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;color: #e03e2d;&quot;&gt;Desired Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years of experience in tech support, analytical roles, and campaign optimization within digital marketing - &lt;strong&gt;must have&lt;/strong&gt;;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in one or more programming languages (e.g. HTML, JavaScript, Apps Script, Python) or experience in the systems integration via API&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with debugging tools (e.g. Google Chrome DevTools), Google Tag Manager.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in using Google Analytics 4, MMP knowledge will be an advantage;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in&amp;nbsp;English&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills are a must;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High level of motivation and willingness to learn;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good time management skills and attention to detail;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;color: #e03e2d;&quot;&gt;We Offer:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We believe in a healthy work-life balance and therefore prioritize flexible working arrangements - you decide whether you want to work remotely, from our office in France, or even temporarily from any other location in the world;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A top-of-the-market compensation package and an attractive bonus scheme;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An international working environment that inspires you and enables you to develop projects as part of a highly qualified cross-functional team;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Training program, budget, and the tools necessary to develop professional skills and personally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A rewarding career in a friendly and inspiring atmosphere with no corporate habits and a growing dynamic multi-cultural team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Apply now!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;You don&#39;t need to tick every box to apply. If you are passionate about digital marketing, send us your CV, and we&#39;ll review it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.datocms-assets.com/64097/1699016700-uk-information-for-applicants.pdf&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Information for Applicants: UK&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Mirakl:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Founded in 2012, Mirakl has been at the forefront of marketplace innovation, empowering every business to compete in the platform economy.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Today, Mirakl’s operating system combines an enterprise marketplace solution (Mirakl Platform) that enables retailers and B2B organizations to launch, scale, and operate marketplaces and dropship, AI-powered multichannel selling (Mirakl Connect), retail media (Mirakl Ads) and an agentic commerce infrastructure (Mirakl Nexus).&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;With dual headquarters in Boston and Paris, Mirakl helps a global ecosystem of 450+ marketplaces (B2C and B2B) and a network of over 100k third-party marketplace sellers. Brands like Macy’s, Decathlon, Carrefour, Asos, and Airbus Helicopters use Mirakl to grow their businesses in new and remarkable ways.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information: &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.mirakl.com&quot;&gt;www.mirakl.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mirakl in Numbers:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🗓️ Founded in 2012 | Member of French Tech Next40&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;👥 750+ employees in 9 offices worldwide: Paris, Barcelona, Bordeaux, Boston, London, Munich, New York, Sydney, Tokyo&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🇫🇷 350+ Mirakl Tech teams members mainly based in France&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;⚙️ 5 Saas Solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Values:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working at Mirakl means accelerating your career alongside ambitious, passionate, and supportive colleagues. We&#39;re proud of the diversity of backgrounds, perspectives, and experiences that make our teams unique.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our 5 values guide how we collaborate:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;💡&lt;strong&gt; Work Hard Together:&lt;/strong&gt; Teamwork and collaboration are the foundation of our success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🏆 &lt;strong&gt;Get Things Done: &lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;We prioritize action and efficiency for impactful results&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🚀 &lt;strong&gt;Go Above &amp;amp; Beyond:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp; We tackle challenges proactively and always aim for excellence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🎓 &lt;strong&gt;Succeed Through Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Knowledge sharing and continuous learning are core to our culture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🤝 &lt;strong&gt;Satisfy &amp;amp; Empower Clients:&lt;/strong&gt; We&#39;re committed to our clients&#39; success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;1. The Team You&#39;ll Join&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll be part of our Mirakl Labs Financial Services squad, based in Paris. The team is structured as a cross-functional Squad composed of a Senior Engineering Manager, a Product Manager, Software Engineers&amp;nbsp; and a QA engineer. You&#39;ll be mentored by &lt;strong&gt;Wael Osmani, Software Engineer&lt;/strong&gt;. &lt;span class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;You’ll join a team that builds and ships the core product features powering some of the world’s most ambitious marketplace platforms, with a particular focus on financial services capabilities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2. Your Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Contribute to the development and evolution of a production application, primarily on the frontend — from UI implementation to user experience improvements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Support backend work by participating in API design and development, collaborating closely with the engineering team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Work hand-in-hand with UX/UI designers to deliver features that are both technically solid and user-centric&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Take part in agile rituals — stand-ups, sprint reviews, and retrospectives — and contribute actively to the team&#39;s roadmap&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Monitor and take ownership of your contributions in production, following a &lt;em&gt;you build it, you run it&lt;/em&gt; mindset&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;3. What You&#39;ll Bring to the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;pb-2 flex flex-col gap-1 list-disc pl-6 text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Currently pursuing a Master&#39;s degree (M1 or M2) in software engineering, computer science, or a related field, and looking for a 6-month internship&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;First hands-on development experience through an internship, academic project, apprenticeship, or personal project&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Solid understanding of frontend development and object-oriented programming principles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;Skills:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;pb-2 flex flex-col gap-1 list-disc pl-6 text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Proficiency or strong interest in frontend frameworks such as &lt;span class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;React&lt;/span&gt; or &lt;span class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;Angular&lt;/span&gt;, and in &lt;span class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;JavaScript/TypeScript&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Familiarity with &lt;span class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;Java&lt;/span&gt; for backend and API development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Curiosity for clean code, software quality, and working on production-grade applications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;A collaborative mindset, intellectual curiosity, and a genuine drive to learn&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;4. Tech Stack&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Back-end:&lt;/strong&gt; Java 21, Spring Boot&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Front-end:&lt;/strong&gt; ReactJS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data &amp;amp; Messaging:&lt;/strong&gt; Kafka, ElasticSearch, PostgreSQL&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tooling &amp;amp; Practices:&lt;/strong&gt; CI/CD, Git, Docker, Monitoring&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;5. Languages&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;French:&lt;/strong&gt; Fluent&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;English:&lt;/strong&gt; Professional proficiency (written and spoken)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation, Perks &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pay Range:&lt;/strong&gt; €1,200 – €1,400 per month&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Hiring Process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We warmly encourage you to apply to any of our roles, even if you think you&#39;re not an exact match.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please click the &quot;Apply&quot; button to submit your application — this helps us make the best possible assessment and get back to you as quickly as possible.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Manual screening of your CV by a recruiter&lt;/strong&gt;, then an &lt;strong&gt;AI-powered screening conversation (10 min) with Emma&lt;/strong&gt;, Mirakl&#39;s AI Talent Ambassador, to explore your background and motivation for the role. You will need to complete this step within 3 days, otherwise we won&#39;t be able to move forward with your application.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Recruiter interview (30 min)&lt;/strong&gt; — conversation about your background, motivations, and an introduction to Mirakl&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hiring Manager interview (45 min)&lt;/strong&gt; — technical discussion covering Java and web development fundamentals, including practical exercises&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;STAR interview (1h)&lt;/strong&gt; — exchange with one or two team members exploring Mirakl&#39;s values and culture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We welcome collaborators with their diverse perspectives and experiences to power us forward. These often far exceed conventional job requirements and help us create a culture of continuous learning. If you’re ready to join a global leader powering digital transformation for 450+ of the world’s most innovative retailers and B2B organizations.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;As part of our recruitment process, Mirakl processes your personal data to review and manage your application and, where appropriate, to consider your profile for future opportunities. You can exercise your data protection rights at any time, and as further detailed in our policies. For more information about how we process your personal data and your rights, please consult our Recruitment Privacy Notice, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.mirakl.com/recruitment-privacy-notice&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt; in English and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.mirakl.com/fr-FR/recruitment-privacy-notice&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt; in French.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We may use Artificial Intelligence (AI) solutions to help streamline our hiring process, including screening applications, analyzing resumes, and assessing responses. While AI helps us work efficiently, all final hiring decisions are made by humans. For more information, visit our &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://info.mirakl.com/ai-guidelines-for-candidates-and-interviews&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;AI Guidelines for Candidates and Interviews&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Der Bereich &lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Data, Tech &amp;amp; Analytics&lt;/span&gt; ist dabei ein strategischer Wachstumstreiber für uns und für die Zukunft unserer Kunden. Wir entwickeln für die Agenturen der WPP Media und deren Kunden intelligente, KI-gestützte und skalierbare Lösungen, die Marketing effektiver, messbarer und kundenzentrierter machen – verbunden durch unsere Plattform WPP Open.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Das bieten wir dir:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work-life-balance:&lt;/strong&gt; Für uns steht Teamarbeit und der persönliche Austausch im Büro im Vordergrund. Wir ermöglichen dir aber auch einen regelmäßigen Homeoffice-Tag für mehr Flexibilität.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We care for you:&lt;/strong&gt; Wir übernehmen deine Kosten für die öffentlichen Verkehrsmittel und du bekommst für jeden Arbeitstag einen 8€ Essensgutschein zur freien Verfügung.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wellbeing first&lt;/strong&gt;: Gesundheitsleistungen, attraktive Altersvorsorge sowie Mental Health Awareness Days stellen deine Gesundheit in den Mittelpunkt.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Practice makes perfect&lt;/strong&gt;: Entfalte dich mit unseren vielfältigen Weiterbildungen und nutze unsere internen Karriereprogramme für deine Entwicklung im WPP-Netzwerk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;More than just a job:&lt;/strong&gt; Dich erwarten unvergessliche Events, Mitarbeitendenrabatte und weitere Highlights&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Be yourself:&lt;/strong&gt; Bei uns ist jede:r herzlich willkommen - Vielfalt und Chancengleichheit liegen uns am Herzen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Das bewegst du&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bist du bereit, die digitale Zukunft des Marketings in der DACH-Region maßgeblich zu prägen?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Als &lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Practice Lead&lt;/span&gt; Media Data Consulting &amp;amp; Solutions (m/w/d) Österreich &amp;amp; Schweiz prägst du die digitale Zukunft unserer Kunden und der Gruppe. Du verwaltest nicht, sondern treibst aktives Wachstum: Du führst ein hochqualifiziertes Expertenteam, verbindest Kunden- und Teaminteressen und etablierst dich als Trusted Advisor, der komplexe Daten- und KI-Potenziale in messbaren Business Value übersetzt.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategische Weiterentwicklung &amp;amp; Teambuilding:&lt;/strong&gt; Du gestaltest die Wachstumsstrategie für den Bereich Data Consulting &amp;amp; Solutions in AT &amp;amp; CH. Du führst unsere bestehenden Fachexpertinnen und -experten zu einer gemeinsamen, schlagkräftigen Einheit zusammen, baust das Leistungsangebot gezielt aus und setzt klare Impulse für nachhaltigen Erfolg.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Teamleitung &amp;amp; Internal Enablement:&lt;/strong&gt; Du übernimmst die disziplinarische und fachliche Führung eines heterogenen Teams aus Consultants, Data Scientists, Analysts und Engineers. Du förderst eine Kultur der Exzellenz und befähigst gleichzeitig unsere Agentur- &amp;amp; Kundenberatungsteams bei Daten-, Tech- &amp;amp; KI-Themen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Top-Kundenberatung &amp;amp; Executive Sponsoring:&lt;/strong&gt; Als strategische:r Ansprechpartner:in berätst du Führungskräfte und Entscheidungsträger:innen unserer wichtigsten Kunden bei komplexen Daten-, Technologie-, KI- und Analytics-Fragestellungen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Geschäftsentwicklung &amp;amp; Partnerships:&lt;/strong&gt; Du verantwortest den Auf- und Ausbau strategischer Partnerschaften mit führenden Technologie-, Daten- und Clean-Room-Anbietern.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Produktentwicklung &amp;amp; WPP Open:&lt;/strong&gt; Du entwickelst ein marktführendes Service- und Produktportfolio (z. B. Data Collaboration, First-Party-Data und AI Consulting) unter proaktiver Nutzung unserer globalen Plattform WPP Open.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Thought Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Du repräsentierst WPP Media im Bereich Data, Tech &amp;amp; Analytics als Vordenker:in auf Branchenveranstaltungen und in Publikationen, um richtungsweisende Impulse abzuleiten.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Das zeichnet dich aus:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team- &amp;amp; Strukturaufbau:&lt;/strong&gt; Nachweisbare Führungserfahrung im Aufbau heterogener Teams sowie in der organisatorischen Weiterentwicklung von Einheiten (z. B. aus Digitalagentur, Mediaagentur, Unternehmensberatung oder aus vergleichbaren Umfeldern).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Berater- &amp;amp; Unternehmergeist:&lt;/strong&gt; Erfahrene Beraterpersönlichkeit für Gespräche mit Senior Stakeholdern, ausgeprägtes Verständnis für Kundenbedürfnisse und Erfolge beim Skalieren datenbasierter Beratungs- und Leistungsangebote.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategisches Denken:&lt;/strong&gt; Vorausschauende Denkweise, um Partnerschaftschancen, Markttrends und neue Wachstumsfelder frühzeitig zu identifizieren und das Leistungsportfolio danach auszurichten.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Expertise in&amp;nbsp;Datenstrategie&lt;/strong&gt; sowie der Übersetzung von Daten- &amp;amp; KI-Anwendungsfällen in betriebswirtschaftlichen Mehrwert (First-Party-Data, Data Governance, Analytics &amp;amp; Data Activation)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Matrix &amp;amp; Kommunikation:&lt;/strong&gt; Souveränes Navigieren in komplexen Matrixorganisationen, proaktive Nutzung globaler Ressourcen für lokale Kundenanforderungen sowie verhandlungssichere Kommunikation auf Deutsch und Englisch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Wenn du diesen Job spannend findest, dann ermutigen wir dich ausdrücklich zur Bewerbung, auch wenn du nicht jede oben gelistete Qualifikation aufweisen kannst.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Wir bieten ein Bruttojahresgehalt ab 100.000 € (Basis 38,5 Std.) mit der Bereitschaft zur Überzahlung.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Arbeiten bei WPP Media:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Als WPP Media gestalten wir die Zukunft der Medien und investieren dabei konsequent in unsere Mitarbeiter:innen. Jede:r Kolleg:in genießt die Vorteile des globalen Netzwerks von WPP Media und WPP, um sich weiterzuentwickeln und an der Spitze von Marketing und Werbung zu lernen. Vielfalt und Zusammenhalt leben wir durch zahlreiche Employee Resource Groups und regelmäßige interne Events - zum Austausch, zur Inspiration und zum gemeinsamen Feiern unserer Erfolge.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;WPP Media ist ein Arbeitgeber, der Chancengleichheit fördert. Wir berücksichtigen alle Bewerber:innen für alle Positionen ohne Diskriminierung. Unser Ziel ist eine Kultur des Respekts und der Zugehörigkeit, in der jede:r die gleichen Möglichkeiten hat, sich einzubringen und beruflich zu wachsen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bitte lies unsere &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;Datenschutzerklärung&lt;/a&gt; für Deutschland, Österreich und die Schweiz, um weitere Informationen darüber zu erhalten, wie wir die von dir bereitgestellten Daten verarbeiten.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch">Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;As a Production Engineer, you will play a key role within our Test Engineering team, programming test software and documenting test procedures to scale production of our next-generation drone platforms. In this position, you will take ownership of verification and production test equipment, from defining test concepts to designing automated test solutions, jigs and needle-bed adapters that help us improve yield and reliability. You’ll collaborate closely with our software and electronics engineers and OEM partners to enhance test coverage and reduce testing time, driving efficiency across our manufacturing process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a hands-on role in a fast-paced, agile environment, offering the opportunity to design creative, practical test solutions from concept through to mass production. This involves balancing the transition from our existing test setups to more scalable and complete solutions in a pragmatic and iterative way for a number of different projects.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Beyond test engineering, you’ll apply your software expertise across the broader hardware and software team by supporting the engineering validation efforts of new products. You will also visit OEMs to support new product integrations and support small scale engineering runs in person.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities and Duties&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Research, design and build test solutions, including auto generated, 3D printed test equipment and CNC milled custom test jigs, and needle-bed adapters to enable low-volume prototyping and mid- to high-volume PCB production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plan and execute product verification, covering test case definition, execution, analysis, and comprehensive documentation, also for repair guidance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write Python code and STM32 firmware to test our embedded products from the inside (selftest) and outside (via test fixture).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with cross-functional engineering teams by offering technical guidance and hands-on support for testing and validation of advanced avionics PCBs and modular systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Specify and document additional manufacturer tests (like flying probe) to allow for a layered, holistic approach to test coverage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write Repair Guides that document the error cases and the affected components.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide manufacturers with new product integrations usually in person in the factory.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage tracking systems across multiple locations to inspect the product workflow.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support internal CI systems with real hardware to validate test procedures before upgrading test fixtures at OEMs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications and Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s or Master&#39;s degree in Electrical Engineering, Computer Science or a related technical field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in modern Python and C/C++ also applied to embedded systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in programming software that runs on real hardware and testing it on real hardware.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CAD experience (e.g., Onshape) and soldering skills are required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical experience in Linux, microcontroller programming, 3D printing, and related prototyping tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pragmatic, solution-oriented mindset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good verbal and written English communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working hours&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stock Options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous holiday allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company pension plan&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Car parking&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhanced maternity &amp;amp; paternity leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mental health and wellbeing support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learning and development opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Auterion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are building the leading software and electronics platform for AI-powered autonomous systems for enterprise and government customers. Our team is supporting the most important missions and solving the most challenging problems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Auterion, we bring together the sharpest minds who love to solve the hardest problems. Join a vibrant team built on innovation, openness, and excellence, where you’ll be empowered to develop ideas, collaborate across all levels, and make an impact that matters.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an enthusiastic Electronics Engineering Intern to gain hands-on experience designing, building, testing, and debugging electronic hardware. Working alongside senior engineers, you’ll contribute across the development cycle—from schematic and PCB design through prototyping, testing, debugging, and documentation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities and Duties&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build, assemble, test, and debug prototype circuits and PCB assemblies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with schematic capture and PCB design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use lab equipment such as oscilloscopes, multimeters, power supplies, and signal generators for testing and troubleshooting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support soldering, rework, and other hands-on laboratory activities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and test firmware for microcontrollers and embedded systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyse test results and document designs, tests, and project progress.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with senior engineers to troubleshoot technical issues and improve hardware performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Follow engineering and laboratory safety procedures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications and Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Currently pursuing a Master’s degree in Electrical/Electronics Engineering or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of analog and digital circuit design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with PCB design tools such as Altium, KiCad, or Eagle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with electronics lab equipment and basic soldering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Programming experience in C, C++, Python, or similar.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with STM32, ESP32, Arduino, or other microcontrollers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of communication protocols such as I²C, SPI, UART, CAN, or USB is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong problem-solving, communication, and teamwork skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience through university, robotics, or personal electronics projects is highly valued.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;EU citizenship required.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working hours&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous holiday allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Car parking&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhanced maternity &amp;amp; paternity leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mental health and wellbeing support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Auterion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are building the leading software platform for AI-powered autonomous systems for enterprise and government customers. Our team is supporting the most important missions and solving the most challenging problems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Auterion, we bring together the sharpest minds who love to solve the hardest problems. Join a vibrant team built on innovation, openness, and excellence, where you’ll be empowered to develop ideas, collaborate across all levels, and make an impact that matters.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;As an Electronics Engineer, you will be a member of our interdisciplinary hardware engineering team, contributing to the design and development of electronics for our next-generation drone platforms. You’ll work on electronic modules such as flight controllers, sensors, and vision systems, supporting PCB development from concept through production.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As part of a cross-functional team, you will contribute to advanced systems such as interceptor and reconnaissance drones with integrated visual navigation, as well as quadcopters for defense applications.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities and Duties&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, prototype, and validate avionics PCBs, sensors, and electronic modules for drone platforms, contributing to designs from initial concepts through detailed design and manufacturing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support PCB and product verification activities, including test planning, execution, and documentation; contribute to electrical and mechanical validation such as EMI/EMC compliance testing, thermal cycling, and mechanical shock testing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and maintain technical documentation, including design concepts, schematics and CAD drawings, bills of materials (BOMs), assembly instructions, and repair documentation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with test engineering, manufacturing, and production teams to support the transition of hardware designs from development to production&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with hardware and software engineers to define electronics requirements, system interfaces, and design solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support troubleshooting and design improvements based on test results, production feedback, and field performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the development and improvement of engineering processes and best practices within the hardware team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications and Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s or Master’s degree in Electrical or Electronics Engineering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years of experience in PCB design and electronic product development, including prototyping, layout, and testing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good understanding of mixed-signal PCB design, signal integrity, and power integrity principles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with PCB testing and troubleshooting, including basic EMC considerations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Altium Designer is highly desirable&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with high-power applications, ESCs, and lithium batteries is an advantage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on, solution-oriented mindset with a proactive approach to problem-solving&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work effectively as part of a cross-functional hardware/software team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good problem-solving and communication skills, with a willingness to learn and take ownership of assigned tasks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CH/EU citizenship required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working hours&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stock Options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous holiday allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company pension plan&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Car parking&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhanced maternity &amp;amp; paternity leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mental health and wellbeing support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
