&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Nebius:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nebius is leading a new era in cloud infrastructure for the global AI economy. We are building a full-stack AI cloud platform that supports developers and enterprises from data and model training through to production deployment, without the cost and complexity of building large in-house AI/ML infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Built by engineers, for engineers. From large-scale GPU orchestration to inference optimization, we own the hard problems across compute, storage, networking and applied AI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Listed on Nasdaq (NBIS) and headquartered in Amsterdam, we have a global footprint with R&amp;amp;D hubs across Europe, the UK, North America and Israel. Our team of 1,500+ includes hundreds of engineers with deep expertise across hardware, software and AI R&amp;amp;D.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;Nebius Token Factory needs scientists who can turn frontier inference bottlenecks into research problems, publish credible work, and then help ship the results into production. This is not a papers-only research role. The Applied Scientist is expected to design rigorous experiments, write strong code, collaborate with engineers, and convert research into deployed inference capabilities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A Senior Applied Scientist owns well-scoped research and production optimization projects. They can publish or prepare high-quality technical work while also producing code, experiments, and prototypes that engineers can use.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt;Your responsibilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2682&quot; data-local-id=&quot;06f359694ab7&quot;&gt;Own focused research projects from hypothesis through experiment, ablation, prototype, and production handoff.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2796&quot; data-local-id=&quot;7c017788c1e5&quot;&gt;Prepare internal reports, technical blogs, or papers when the work is externally credible.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2890&quot; data-local-id=&quot;7efe020884ba&quot;&gt;Partner directly with MLEs to ensure research prototypes become usable production components.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2987&quot; data-local-id=&quot;1481cbfe2c41&quot;&gt;Define and execute research programs in efficient LLM and &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;VLM&lt;/span&gt; inference with measurable production impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3097&quot; data-local-id=&quot;87a2ac19f5af&quot;&gt;Invent, evaluate, and productionize methods for quantization, &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_kqswh2mm&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_5pioz8co _189e1dm9 _1il9buyh _19lc184f _d0altlke&quot; data-testid=&quot;definition-highlighter&quot;&gt;QAT&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;, distillation, speculative decoding, &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;KV&lt;/span&gt;-cache reuse, &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;KV&lt;/span&gt;-cache compression, long-context inference, &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;MoE&lt;/span&gt; routing, and model/runtime co-optimization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3313&quot; data-local-id=&quot;01d7f1451adb&quot;&gt;Build high-quality prototypes in PyTorch, Triton, &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;CUDA&lt;/span&gt;-adjacent tooling, or inference-serving frameworks, then work with MLEs and platform engineers to productionize them.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3488&quot; data-local-id=&quot;7252b6ce1513&quot;&gt;Design rigorous evaluation methodology covering quality, latency, throughput, numerical stability, memory footprint, tail latency, and cost per token.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3642&quot; data-local-id=&quot;c70959baf3b3&quot;&gt;Publish papers, technical reports, blog posts, and open-source artifacts that build external credibility for Nebius Token Factory.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3776&quot; data-local-id=&quot;ccb9fc6eec1b&quot;&gt;Collaborate with MLE, GPU kernel, backend infrastructure, product, and customer teams to choose high-leverage research bets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3904&quot; data-local-id=&quot;b653633dbf1f&quot;&gt;Mentor engineers and scientists on experimental design, scientific rigor, and model/system tradeoffs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt;Must-haves&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4036&quot; data-local-id=&quot;d0838f7fe31a&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;PhD&lt;/span&gt; in computer science, machine learning, ML systems, computer systems, computer architecture, electrical engineering, applied math, or a closely related field.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4201&quot; data-local-id=&quot;d6a3c2d74b2c&quot;&gt;Strong publication record or equivalent research artifacts in ML, ML systems, efficient inference, model compression, quantization, distillation, serving systems, or related areas.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4385&quot; data-local-id=&quot;5f311fbd5e78&quot;&gt;Strong hands-on coding ability in Python and PyTorch; ability to move from idea to experiment to prototype quickly.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4504&quot; data-local-id=&quot;12c5979cb37e&quot;&gt;Deep understanding of LLMs, VLMs, transformer inference, decoding algorithms, model compression, quantization, and production-serving tradeoffs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4652&quot; data-local-id=&quot;2a3641ca38bf&quot;&gt;Strong experimental design skills, including ablations, baselines, metrics, statistical reasoning, and failure analysis.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4776&quot; data-local-id=&quot;5ad1594b4f5b&quot;&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt;Nice&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt;to&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt;have&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt;s&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4851&quot; data-local-id=&quot;7b1fc9cd775f&quot;&gt;First-author publications in NeurIPS, &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;ICML&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;ICLR&lt;/span&gt;, MLSys, &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;ACL&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;EMNLP&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;ASPLOS&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;OSDI&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;SOSP&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;ISCA&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;HPCA&lt;/span&gt;, or comparable venues.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4977&quot; data-local-id=&quot;dfddd25a2b60&quot;&gt;Experience deploying ML models or inference optimizations in production.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5053&quot; data-local-id=&quot;389d84a803be&quot;&gt;Experience with vLLM, SGLang, TensorRT-LLM, &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;NVIDIA&lt;/span&gt; Dynamo, FlashAttention, FlashInfer, Triton, &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;CUDA&lt;/span&gt;, or PyTorch internals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5179&quot; data-local-id=&quot;a23b78c77076&quot;&gt;Experience with post-training, &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_kqswh2mm&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_5pioz8co _189e1dm9 _1il9buyh _19lc184f _d0altlke&quot; data-testid=&quot;definition-highlighter&quot;&gt;SFT&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_kqswh2mm&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_5pioz8co _189e1dm9 _1il9buyh _19lc184f _d0altlke&quot; data-testid=&quot;definition-highlighter&quot;&gt;DPO&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_kqswh2mm&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_5pioz8co _189e1dm9 _1il9buyh _19lc184f _d0altlke&quot; data-testid=&quot;definition-highlighter&quot;&gt;RLHF&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_kqswh2mm&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_5pioz8co _189e1dm9 _1il9buyh _19lc184f _d0altlke&quot; data-testid=&quot;definition-highlighter&quot;&gt;RLAIF&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;, preference optimization, or synthetic data generation when connected to inference quality or efficiency.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5341&quot; data-local-id=&quot;549bd0ecdba4&quot;&gt;Open-source research artifacts, widely used benchmarks, high-quality technical blogs, or invited talks in efficient AI systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits &amp;amp; Perks:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive compensation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Career growth and learning opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexibility and ownership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative and innovative culture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunity to work on impactful AI projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;International environment and talented teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What&#39;s it like to work at Nebius:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fast moving&amp;nbsp;- Bold thinking&amp;nbsp;- Constant growth&amp;nbsp;- Meaningful impact&amp;nbsp;- Trust and real ownership&amp;nbsp;- Opportunity to shape the future of AI&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity Statement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nebius is an equal opportunity employer. We are committed to fostering an inclusive and diverse workplace and to providing equal employment opportunities in all aspects of employment. We do not discriminate on the basis of race, color, religion, sex (including pregnancy), national origin, ancestry, age, disability, genetic information, marital status, veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by applicable law.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Applicants must be authorized to work in the country in which they apply and will be required to provide proof of employment eligibility as a condition of hire.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you need accommodations during the application process, please let us know.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;Joining Capco means becoming part of an innovative and dynamic consultancy firm, committed to fostering an inclusive environment where you are encouraged to #BeYourselfAtWork. We embrace individuality as a key factor in promoting diversity and inclusion, values that sit at the core of our success. We aim to attract a wide variety of talented professionals with different skills and experiences. If you require any adjustments to support your application process, please feel free to inform us at any stage.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT CAPCO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Capco is a global technology and business consultancy that is passionate about supporting clients in the financial services sector to grow and succeed in today&#39;s ever-changing world. We are:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experts in banking, capital markets, payments and asset and wealth management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Trusted advisors in core banking, securities and wealth management transformation, regulatory change, risk management and technology modernization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A company dedicated to continuous development and excited to welcome top talent to help us drive innovation and deliver lasting results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A business built on agility, collaboration, and entrepreneurial spirit.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE ROLE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an experienced Senior Business Analyst to help shape the strategic transformation of our Financial Crime Compliance (FCC) and Market Conduct &amp;amp; Trade Surveillance (MCTS) capabilities within Legal &amp;amp; Compliance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working at the intersection of compliance, business, technology, architecture and data, you will shape strategic target states, assess current capabilities and translate business and control objectives into prioritised transformation roadmaps and actionable requirements. You will facilitate complex cross-functional decisions and provide clear recommendations to senior management.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will act as the senior business-analysis and transformation lead for selected FCC and MCTS initiatives, shaping target states and roadmaps while working in close partnership with Compliance, Technology, Architecture, Data and Programme Management.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;YOUR CAPCO DAY&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the business definition of strategic target states, facilitating alignment across Compliance, Technology, Architecture and Data and ensuring that agreed target states are translated into actionable transformation plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assess current capabilities and conduct gap analyses across processes, organisation, systems, architecture, data quality and governance, translating findings into prioritised transformation measures and investment considerations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define business and technology requirements and develop relevant use cases and options, including opportunities to improve data quality, reduce false positives, automate and scale alert handling, and strengthen monitoring and surveillance processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate target states into structured multi-year transformation roadmaps, defining priorities, milestones, dependencies, sequencing, responsibilities, investment considerations and key trade-offs across risk reduction, regulatory need, business value and delivery feasibility. Facilitate cross-functional decision-making across business, technology and control functions, frame key options and trade-offs, and prepare concise recommendations and decision materials for senior&amp;nbsp;management. Define measurable transformation outcomes and success criteria, such as improved control effectiveness, reduced manual effort and false positives, better data quality and lineage, increased automation, and improved operational scalability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure traceability from regulatory, policy and control objectives through business requirements, solution design and implementation outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;YOUR CAPCO FIT&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated Financial Crime Compliance expertise combined with project and ideally consulting experience in the design and digital transformation of FCC solutions within a comparable financial-services environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong ability to work across business architecture, solution/enterprise architecture and data disciplines, translating business and control requirements into architectural, process and data implications.” Strong expertise in Financial Crime Compliance, with deep experience in one or more core domains such as AML/CTF, sanctions or PEP screening, and sufficient breadth to work effectively across adjacent FCC areas including tax compliance.Proven change and organisational capabilities, particularly stakeholder management and facilitation, Target Operating Model definition and the preparation of decision materials for senior management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong conceptual and analytical capabilities, with experience translating strategic target states into prioritised multi-year roadmaps and implementation plans within complex transformation environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent English and German are a must for this role.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;BONUS POINTS FOR&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience within Market Conduct, Trade Surveillance or comparable monitoring and surveillance environments; deep MCTS expertise is advantageous but not required where the candidate brings strong transferable FCC transformation experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing strategic concepts spanning Financial Crime Compliance, Legal &amp;amp; Compliance and wider banking transformation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with surveillance challenges such as false-positive reduction, alert management, data quality and the integration of relevant communications and market information.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience assessing investment requirements and prioritising transformation initiatives across three-to-five-year roadmaps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience coordinating transformation plans with wider enterprise architecture, technology or bank-wide strategic programmes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ready to take the Next Step&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If this sounds like you, we would love to hear from you. This is an opportunity to make a difference and contribute to a highly successful company with a significant growth trajectory.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Everpure (NYSE: P) has evolved from storage pioneer to data platform, closing fiscal 2026 with $3.7 billion in revenue, its first billion-dollar quarter, and accelerating growth into FY27. Our strategic agenda spans the companies defining the next era of technology - hyperscalers, AI labs, the AI hardware supply chain, data platform providers, and the broader AI ecosystem.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This type of work—work that changes the world—is what the tech industry was founded on. So, if you&#39;re ready to seize the endless opportunities and leave your mark, come join us.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE ROLE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Healthcare &amp;amp; Life Sciences Principal, Business Development (EMEA), you will partner with EMEA Sales and Sales Engineering leaders to shape and execute the region’s HLS growth strategy. You will connect market opportunity to field execution: prioritizing segments and accounts, developing repeatable vertical and horizontal plays, strengthening the organization and partner ecosystem, and leading critical customer and alliance initiatives. You will be expected to operate comfortably at three levels:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;● Strategic: Define where and how Everpure should win in European healthcare and life sciences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;● Organizational: Build the capabilities, coverage, relationships, and operating cadence required to scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;● Commercial: Personally advance priority opportunities, alliances, and executive relationships to closed business and measurable customer value.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The role requires a combination of HLS credibility, technical fluency in data and AI platforms, commercial ownership, and the ability to influence across country sales, SE, partners, and corporate teams without relying on formal authority.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU&#39;LL DO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the Pipeline &amp;amp; Financial Performance:&lt;/strong&gt; Own the booking targets and financial performance for the segment by developing and executing a multi year strategic growth plan. Drive and scale the overarching pipeline and bookings targets across the EMEA ecosystem, establishing clear qualification criteria and pipeline visibility.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Define the EMEA Value Proposition:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Define and articulate the value proposition for Healthcare &amp;amp; Life Sciences to drive growth and establish Everpure as the industry leader.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Architect &amp;amp; Execute Joint GTM Plans:&lt;/strong&gt; Author and launch strategic go-to-market plans with priority partners, aligning internal cross-functional EMEA teams (Partner Account Teams, Core Sales, Alliances, Marketing) to unlock high-potential HLS customer accounts and activate new revenue streams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Orchestrate Strategic Alliances:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Orchestrate strategic vertical alliances and operationalize relationships with key partners to secure reference architectures and joint go to market motions.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enable and Mobilize the Partner Ecosystem:&lt;/strong&gt; Equip sales teams and partners with the specialized tools, training, and playbooks they need to successfully position and sell vertical solutions. Train and align Partner representatives ensuring they can effectively articulate our value proposition, economic differentiation, and technical sizing for healthcare compliance.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Joint Demand Gen &amp;amp; Thought Leadership:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Act as a spokesperson for your vertical vision in customer meetings, industry events, analyst briefings, and media opportunities. Build credibility as a principal advisor by shaping the industry narrative around intelligent data foundations and enterprise AI adoption.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU BRING&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;HLS &amp;amp; Alliance Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven success leading strategic business development or alliance management within the technology sector, with a deep understanding of customers solutions, cloud economics, and the specific regulatory, data, and compliance needs of the EMEA Healthcare and Life Sciences sector.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Influence &amp;amp; Execution:&lt;/strong&gt; Develop and execute the global strategy for your segment in partnership with Product Management, Sales, and Engineering teams. A track record of balancing high-level strategy with a &quot;roll-up-your-sleeves&quot; execution mindset, showing a strong ability to build trust and influence executive leaders across partner organizations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agile Collaboration &amp;amp; Communication:&lt;/strong&gt; Outstanding business acumen and communication skills, with a collaborative approach to thriving in a fast-paced, cross-functional, and multi-cultural EMEA environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location &amp;amp; Travel:&lt;/strong&gt; We operate in a hybrid/field-based model. You will be expected to work effectively from a regional corporate office in a key EMEA market, with the ability to travel 25–40% across the region as business needs require.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU CAN EXPECT FROM US:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Innovation&lt;/strong&gt;: We celebrate those who think critically, like a challenge, and aspire to be trailblazers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth&lt;/strong&gt;: We give you the space and support to grow along with us and to contribute to something meaningful. We have been named Fortune&#39;s Best Workplaces in Technology™, Fortune&#39;s Best Workplaces in the Bay Area™, and certified as a Great Place to Work®!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team&lt;/strong&gt;: We build each other up and set aside ego for the greater good.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;And because we understand the value of bringing your full and best self to work, we offer a variety of perks to manage a healthy balance, including flexible time off, wellness resources, and company-sponsored team events. Check out &lt;a href=&quot;http://benefits.everpuredata.com/&quot;&gt;http://benefits.everpuredata.com/ &lt;/a&gt;for more information.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ACCOMMODATIONS AND ACCESSIBILITY:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Candidates with disabilities may request accommodations for all aspects of our hiring process. For more on this, contact us at &lt;a ---------- if you’re invited to an interview.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;OUR COMMITMENT TO A STRONG AND INCLUSIVE TEAM:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re forging a future where everyone finds their rightful place and where every voice matters. Where uniqueness isn’t just accepted but embraced. That’s why we are committed to fostering the growth and development of every person, cultivating a sense of community through our Employee Resource Groups and advocating for inclusive leadership.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Everpure is proud to be an equal opportunity employer. We do not discriminate based upon race, religion, color, national origin, sex (including pregnancy, childbirth, or related medical conditions), sexual orientation, gender, gender identity, gender expression, transgender status, sexual stereotypes, age, status as a protected veteran, status as an individual with a disability, or any other characteristic legally protected by the laws of the jurisdiction in which you are being considered for hire.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us and bring your best.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bring your bold.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pure and simple.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch">Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Playlist, life&#39;s richest moments happen when people step away from screens to move, connect, explore, and play. We&#39;re building the definitive platform for intentional living, connecting people with inspiring experiences in fitness, wellness, and beyond. With popular brands like Mindbody and ClassPass, Playlist empowers businesses and individuals, making it effortless for aspirations to become actions. Join us in reshaping technology&#39;s role to foster meaningful, real-world connections.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;ClassPass offers thousands of fitness and wellness experiences worldwide, helping people lead active, balanced lifestyles. Our platform makes discovering and enjoying activities simple, personalized, and joyful—whether it&#39;s fitness classes, self-care sessions, a healthy lunch, or a new adventure. Join us in shaping healthier, more vibrant communities around the globe.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Über das Team&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;text-text-05 font-main-content-body&quot;&gt;Das ClassPass International Team ist für das Wachstum und die Stärkung unseres Partner-Ökosystems in den globalen Märkten verantwortlich. Gemeinsam mit EGYM Wellpass, beide Teil der Playlist-Familie, nutzen wir gezielt Synergien, um unser Angebot noch stärker zu machen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;text-text-05 font-main-content-body&quot;&gt;Dazu gehören sowohl die Akquise hochwertiger neuer Partner aus den Bereichen Fitness, Wellness und Erlebnisangebote als auch die Pflege und der Ausbau der Beziehungen zu bestehenden Partnern.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;text-text-05 font-main-content-body&quot;&gt;Durch die Kombination aus Marktexpertise, starken lokalen Beziehungen sowie strategischem Vertriebs- und Account-Management stellt das Team sicher, dass wir unseren Mitgliedern einen außergewöhnlichen Mehrwert und unseren Partnern langfristigen Erfolg bieten.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Über die Rolle&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;text-text-05 font-main-content-body&quot;&gt;Als &lt;strong&gt;Field Account Executive in der Region Bielefeld/Münster&lt;/strong&gt; bist du für das Wachstum unseres Partnernetzwerks in deiner Region verantwortlich. Du gewinnst neue Partner aus den Bereichen Wellness, Fitness und Gesundheit für ClassPass und baust Beziehungen zu bestehenden Partnern weiter aus.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;text-text-05 font-main-content-body&quot;&gt;Dadurch trägst du maßgeblich dazu bei, dass Tausende Endkund:innen echten Mehrwert durch einen gesunden Lebensstil erleben.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;text-text-05 font-main-content-body&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lust auf echten Impact? Dann bewirb dich jetzt!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Deine Aufgaben&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du identifizierst und akquirierst eigenverantwortlich neue Partner aus den Bereichen Fitness, Wellness und Gesundheit und verantwortest deine eigene Sales Pipeline, von der ersten Kontaktaufnahme bis zum Vertragsabschluss.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du baust langfristige, vertrauensbasierte Beziehungen zu deinen Partnern auf und unterstützt sie bei operativen Fragen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du lebst ein Field-first-Mindset: Persönliche Vor-Ort-Termine stehen bei dir an erster Stelle, ergänzt durch gezielte Inside-Sales-Taktiken, um deine Pipeline voranzutreiben.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du baust dir ein starkes Netzwerk in der regionalen Fitness- und Wellness-Community auf.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du dokumentierst deine Aktivitäten strukturiert in Salesforce und überzeugst potenzielle Partner bis zum erfolgreichen Vertragsabschluss.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Das bringst du mit&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du bringst ein bis zwei Jahre Vertriebserfahrung mit, idealerweise aus einem schnelllebigen B2B-Umfeld, und beherrschst Field- sowie Inside-Sales-Techniken sicher.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du kannst einen erfolgreichen Track Record vorweisen und erreichst oder übertriffst deine monatlichen Ziele regelmäßig.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du wohnst in Bielefeld, Münster oder der näheren Umgebung und kennst die Region, die Menschen und die lokale Kultur. Erste Kontakte in die Fitness- und Wellnessbranche sind ein Plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du hast idealerweise Erfahrung mit Salesforce oder Salesloft und bist sicher im Umgang mit Microsoft Office.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du bist bereit, regelmäßig in deiner Region unterwegs zu sein.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du sprichst Deutsch auf muttersprachlichem Niveau und verfügst über sichere Englischkenntnisse.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Deine Benefits&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 Urlaubstage pro Jahr plus zusätzliche, unternehmensweite monatliche &lt;strong&gt;Wellness Days&lt;/strong&gt; zum Auftanken, etwa ein Tag pro Monat.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remote-Arbeit in deiner Region mit der Option auf eine &lt;strong&gt;WeWork All Access-Mitgliedschaft&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vergünstigter ClassPass-Tarif und kostenloser Zugang zur Meditations-App &lt;strong&gt;Calm&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monatliche Zuschüsse: &lt;strong&gt;52 € Wellness-Budget&lt;/strong&gt; über Benepass sowie eine &lt;strong&gt;50 € Homeoffice-Pauschale&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professionelle Unterstützung für deine mentale Gesundheit über &lt;strong&gt;Spring Health&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familienplanungs- und Fruchtbarkeitsleistungen über &lt;strong&gt;Carrot&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Teilnahme an unserem Anerkennungsprogramm &lt;strong&gt;Bonusly&lt;/strong&gt;, mit dem wir besondere Leistungen gemeinsam feiern.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Kontakt&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;text-text-05 font-main-content-body&quot;&gt;Du hast Fragen zur Rolle oder zum Bewerbungsprozess? Dann melde dich gerne direkt bei mir. Ich freue mich, von dir zu hören!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;text-text-05 font-main-content-body&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Kontaktperson: Ainura Kukshebayeva&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Have we piqued your curiosity?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sound like the role for you? We’d love to hear from you! Even if you’re not 100% sure about potential fit, we still encourage you to apply. We’re looking for the right person, not the perfect series of checkboxes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Company is an Equal Opportunity Employer. We highly value diversity at our company and encourage people of all different backgrounds, experiences, abilities and perspectives to apply. We do not discriminate on the basis of race, religion, color, national origin, gender, sexual orientation, age, marital status, veteran status, disability status, or other protected characteristics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;By entering your email and phone number and submitting your application, you consent to receive emails, calls and SMS about your application and other roles at The Company, including by auto-dialer. Message and data rates may apply. Opt-out or text STOP to cancel at any time. If you are a California resident or reside outside the United States then by submitting your application you confirm that you have read, understood, agree and - where applicable - grant your prior, free, informed and express consent for the processing of your personal information, including sensitive personal information, as described in our &lt;a href=&quot;https://co.mindbodyonline.com/legal/california-privacy-policy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;California Applicant Privacy Notice&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; or &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://co.mindbodyonline.com/legal/international-team-member-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;International Applicant Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;(as applicable).&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHY JOIN ALO?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Mindful movement. It’s at the core of why we do what we do at ALO—it’s our calling. Because mindful movement in the studio leads to better living. It changes who yogis are off the mat, making their lives and their communities better. That’s the real meaning of studio-to-street: taking the consciousness from practice on the mat and putting it into practice in life.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;OVERVIEW&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Director of Asset Protection &amp;amp; Safety International, based out of London, leads ALO’s enterprise protection strategy across international retail markets, ensuring operational integrity, the safety of our people and guests, and the protection of company assets. This leader combines operational discipline, innovation, and mindful leadership to protect both performance and brand experience across diverse regulatory, cultural, and risk environments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Director is responsible for developing, standardizing, and scaling a comprehensive international retail protection program across the UK, Europe, and APAC. This role integrates operational risk management, safety governance, investigations, and resilience into a cohesive strategy that positions ALO’s Asset Protection &amp;amp; Safety organization as a global center of excellence for protection and prevention. This role will report into the Sr. Director Asset Protection &amp;amp; Safety&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This leader is both visionary and practical, using data, technology, and human insight to anticipate emerging risks and create scalable solutions that sustain trust, profitability, and operational excellence across international markets. The role partners across Operations, People &amp;amp; Culture, Legal, Finance, IT, Facilities, and Supply Chain to ensure ALO’s protection and safety programs evolve ahead of industry trends while remaining compliant with local laws and cultural expectations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;RESPONSIBILITIES&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Leadership &amp;amp; Culture&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, coach, and inspire a high-performing international field organization, including Regional Asset Protection Managers and supporting Asset Protection and Safety resources across multiple countries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foster a culture of accountability, transparency, and care that supports safety, team engagement, and business performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Model and embody ALO’s Guiding Principles of mindful movement, community, intention, and purpose.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with international retail and field leaders to reinforce consistent execution of Asset Protection and Safety standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain visible engagement in the field to assess readiness and reinforce duty of care expectations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Strategic Direction &amp;amp; Execution&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead ALO’s international Asset Protection &amp;amp; Safety strategy across External Risk, Internal Integrity, Operational Excellence, and People Protection.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish scalable governance models aligning global standards with local regulatory requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure strategies are data-informed and aligned to long-term growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;External Risk&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop proactive strategies to deter and respond to external theft and organized retail crime.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build relationships with law enforcement, security partners, and retail coalitions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee theft and fraud case management and recovery efforts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent ALO in international protection networks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee security vendor programs and guard force management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Internal Integrity&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead internal investigations with discretion and cultural sensitivity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with People &amp;amp; Culture and Legal on compliant case handling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee restitution, recovery, and authority coordination.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure cash-handling integrity and audit consistency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reinforce ethical behavior and accountability programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Operational Excellence&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner cross-functionally to mitigate controllable loss.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Standardize international retail audit programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use analytics to forecast risk and guide prevention.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support new store openings and remodels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;People Protection, Safety &amp;amp; Business Continuity&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion a culture of safety, preparedness, and wellbeing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide executive oversight of workplace violence prevention.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee crisis management and business continuity frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure compliance with health and safety regulations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead post-incident reviews and resilience planning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Technology, Analytics &amp;amp; Innovation&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Modernize protection and safety platforms through technology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Optimize systems for reporting and analytics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate innovative prevention tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee physical security and life-safety systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Present insights and outcomes to executive leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;QUALIFICATIONS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Criminal Justice, Business, Risk Management, or related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fifteen or more years of progressive leadership experience with international scope.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven success building scalable protection and safety programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience overseeing investigations, audits, crisis response, and business continuity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of international retail risk and safety governance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent leadership and communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High integrity and sound judgment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel internationally up to 40 to 50 percent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;c-scrollbar__hider&quot; data-qa=&quot;slack_kit_scrollbar&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;c-scrollbar__child&quot;&gt;
