&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Extensive experience designing and building large-scale distributed systems in production environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Strong expertise in at least one core language: Golang, C++, or Ruby&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with JavaScript/TypeScript and React is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Proven track record of technical leadership beyond team boundaries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Deep understanding of system design, algorithms, and data structures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Experience with modern backend architectures, APIs, and service-oriented systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Solid background in automated testing strategies (TDD, BDD, integration testing)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Strong knowledge of PostgreSQL and data modeling is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Understanding of networking fundamentals (TCP/IP , UDP , etc.) is highly valuable&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Experience working in Agile environments with cross-functional collaboration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Ability to operate in high-trust, high-confidentiality environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
