&lt;p&gt;Do you care about how things work under the hood and don&#39;t shy away from complex, interconnected systems? Do you know how to independently investigate problems, build reliable test coverage, and guide others in maintaining a high bar for quality?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About JetBrains&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We create intelligent software development tools for developers and teams. More than 15 million users, over 300,000 companies, and 88 of the Fortune Global Top 100 rely on our products to solve real, complex problems. Our mission is simple: make development teams more productive and AI adoptable at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Core team handles the foundational pieces of the IntelliJ Platform, including the editor, indexing, settings, and plugins. These systems are highly complex and used across all JetBrains IDEs, meaning your work directly impacts the daily workflows of millions of developers. You’ll take full ownership of the QA domain for this team, ensuring the stability of both established components and temporary cross-team projects. You’ll work closely with developers to investigate technical problems, coordinate testing efforts, and ensure we ship reliable, high-quality features.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Day to day, you will:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and maintain UI, end-to-end, functional, and integration tests across Linux, Windows, and macOS.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze test failures and track test coverage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Test new functionality, focusing on complex scenarios, edge cases, and potential coverage gaps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve test diagnostics, frameworks, and CI/CD pipelines to reduce flakiness and increase reliability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor a junior QA engineer by helping plan tasks, reviewing work, and answering technical questions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate risks, roadblocks, and investigation results clearly to the development team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own your QA domain end to end, proactively identifying priorities, planning your work, and driving quality initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong sense of ownership over the quality and stability of complex systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to navigate incomplete requirements and find the information needed to move forward.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A practical approach to problem-solving, with a focus on resolving issues independently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative mindset for working closely with developers and other cross-functional teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An eye for spotting risks, missing scenarios, and areas for process improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A willingness to guide and support less-experienced engineers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll need&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An extensive background in software quality assurance and test automation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong programming skills to develop, maintain, and debug UI tests.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with testing frameworks like JUnit or TestNG.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The proven ability to investigate and troubleshoot failures across products, infrastructure, and environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in written and spoken English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What success looks like&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ve established a reliable, stable testing infrastructure for the Core team, significantly reducing test flakiness and improving diagnostic capabilities. You proactively identify quality risks before releases, keep developers unblocked, and ensure the junior engineers you mentor are confidently taking on more complex tasks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Why join JetBrains?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong base salary. We offer competitive pay that reflects your skills and experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible work location. Enjoy the freedom to work from home or from the office.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remote work. Spend up to 30 days per year working remotely from abroad.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extra time off. More days to relax, recharge, and do the things you love.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Medical insurance allowance. Enjoy peace of mind for you and your family&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learning and development opportunities. Access to conferences, courses, and language classes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relocation support. We help make your move as smooth and stress-free as possible.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Language classes. Pick up the local language or sharpen your English skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fuel your day. Enjoy a hot meal or receive a lunch allowance on workdays.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mental health support. To help you feel your best, we provide easy access to professional mental health services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sports benefit. Enjoy an on-site gym or sports club stipend.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Internal events. Join company-wide celebrations and team gatherings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;*Some benefits may vary depending on location.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;#LI-DNI&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We are an equal opportunity employer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We know great ideas can come from anyone, anywhere. That’s why we do our best to create an open and inclusive workplace – one that welcomes everyone regardless of their background, identity, religion, age, accessibility needs, or orientation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;We process the data provided in your job application in accordance with the&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.jetbrains.com/legal/docs/privacy/privacy-recruitment/&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Founding Tech Lead (GrowthBricks)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Are you a hands-on engineer who loves zero-to-one challenges? Do you want to build systems with real context and memory that do more than reason, use tools, and drive actual business outcomes?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About JetBrains&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We create intelligent software development tools for developers and teams. More than 15 million users, over 300,000 companies, and 88 of the Fortune Global Top 100 rely on our products to solve real, complex problems. Our mission is simple: make development teams more productive and AI adoptable at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;GrowthBricks is a new project at JetMinds, backed by JetBrains, designed to give GTM teams and AI agents a shared business brain. Business context usually gets fragmented across CRMs, documents, dashboards, and people&#39;s heads. GrowthBricks brings that context together so agents and people can make decisions and execute effectively across the sales, marketing, and product stack.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As our Founding Tech Lead, you will own the technical architecture and core systems from the ground up. Working directly with the product founder, you&#39;ll tackle the core challenge of turning messy, shifting business data into reliable memory and agent actions, then measuring whether those actions deliver real results. You will shape the product primitives, write much of the early code, and decide how our technical approach evolves as we learn what works.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Day to day, you will:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design the core architecture across business context, agents, memory, tools, and feedback loops.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build agentic workflows that reason over company context and act across CRM, sales, marketing, and product systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create context extractors to process sales calls, emails, internal docs, CRM states, and campaign data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with prompting, context management, memory, tool choice, and orchestration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Connect GrowthBricks directly to the existing GTM stack rather than rebuilding existing tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Decide where to leverage MCP, APIs, or open-source frameworks, and where custom solutions are worth building.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prototype quickly, discard weak ideas, and turn effective ones into production primitives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort working in zero-to-one environments with high technical autonomy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A practical mindset that values clear, simple solutions over unnecessary complexity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confidence making key architectural decisions when requirements are still evolving.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A focus on end-user impact and willingness to iterate based on real feedback.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll need&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience building, evaluating, and refining LLM applications, agents, or agentic workflows used by real people.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience designing backend systems, data models, APIs, and integrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A working knowledge of context management, memory patterns, prompting strategies, and tool orchestration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A practical understanding of modern GTM stacks (such as CRMs, enrichment tools, or marketing automation) or sales/marketing workflows is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What success looks like&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In your first six months, you will have moved GrowthBricks from a blank repository to a functional product with core primitives for context extraction, memory, and orchestration. Success means building reliable workflows that real users rely on daily, establishing a pragmatic codebase, and validating that agent actions produce measurable business value.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why join JetBrains?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong base salary – We offer competitive pay that reflects your skills and experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible work schedule – Enjoy the freedom to work from home or from the office.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extra time off – More days to relax, recharge, and do the things you love.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learning and development opportunities – Access to conferences, courses, and language classes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relocation support – Assistance to help make your move as smooth and stress-free as possible.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free meals and snacks – Lunch and refreshments provided to keep you fueled.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health and wellness – On-site gyms or sports club stipends.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Internal events – Company-wide celebrations and team gatherings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are an equal opportunity employer. We know great ideas can come from anyone, anywhere. That’s why we do our best to create an open and inclusive workplace – one that welcomes everyone regardless of their background, identity, religion, age, accessibility needs, or orientation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If this sounds like a challenge you&#39;d enjoy, we’d love to hear from you. Send us your resume and a brief overview of what you&#39;ve built.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About GrowthBricks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;GrowthBricks is a shared business brain for GTM teams and AI agents.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;It brings together the context that usually lives across CRM, docs, dashboards, tools, and people’s heads: who we sell to, why customers buy, what matters now, what we tried, and what worked. Agents and people use that context to decide what to do next and execute across the GTM stack.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;GrowthBricks is a new project at JetMinds, backed by JetBrains.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a hands-on Founding Tech Lead to build GrowthBricks from zero.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll work directly with the product founder and own the technical side of the product: architecture, core systems, integrations, and the agent layer.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The core challenge is turning fragmented, changing business context into reliable memory and agent actions across tools and measuring whether those actions actually drive business outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll write a lot of the early code yourself, make the key technical decisions, and shape the product as we learn what works.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll work on&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design the core architecture: business context, agents, tools, integrations, and feedback loops.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build agentic workflows that can reason over company context and act across CRM, sales, marketing, and product systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build context extractors from GTM team artifacts like sales calls, emails, internal documents, CRM state, marketing campaigns, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work on prompting, context management, memory, tool use, and orchestration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Connect GrowthBricks to the existing GTM stack rather than rebuilding everything around it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Decide where to use MCP, APIs, frameworks, or third-party tools and where a custom solution is worth it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prototype fast, discard weak ideas, and turn the useful ones into product primitives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We expect that you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are a strong hands-on engineer who enjoys zero-to-one work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have built with LLMs, agents, or agentic workflows used by real people, and improved them based on failures, evaluations, and user feedback.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand how context, prompting, tools, and agent behavior fit together.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Can design backend systems, APIs, data models, and integrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are comfortable making decisions before all the answers are known.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prefer simple, pragmatic solutions over unnecessary complexity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We’re especially interested if you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have worked in solution engineering, sales engineering, pre-sales, or built software for GTM teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand the modern GTM stack: CRM, enrichment, outbound, automation, and product signals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have automated sales or marketing workflows, ideally with agents or LLMs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have owned a technical product from a blank repo to something people actually used.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;GTM experience is not mandatory, but if you already understand how sales and marketing teams work, that is a strong advantage.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A competitive salary and strong benefits package.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The runway and resources of an established company, with startup-level autonomy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A founding role with direct influence over both product and architecture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Real users and real workflows from day one.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Freedom to choose the stack, tools, and technical approach.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A chance to help define what an agent-native GTM product should look like.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;#LI-IM1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We are an equal opportunity employer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We know great ideas can come from anyone, anywhere. That’s why we do our best to create an open and inclusive workplace – one that welcomes everyone regardless of their background, identity, religion, age, accessibility needs, or orientation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;We process the data provided in your job application in accordance with the&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.jetbrains.com/legal/docs/privacy/privacy-recruitment/&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p data-start=&quot;213&quot; data-end=&quot;305&quot;&gt;AI is fundamentally changing how developers write, understand, debug, and maintain software.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;307&quot; data-end=&quot;665&quot;&gt;At JetBrains, we&#39;re exploring what an AI-native development experience should look like for C++ developers. We are looking for a senior technical leader to help shape this future by building AI-powered workflows, integrating coding agents into developer tools, and defining how CLion can become a first-class environment for AI-assisted software development.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;667&quot; data-end=&quot;1126&quot;&gt;This is a highly hands-on role focused on technical leadership rather than people management. You should expect to spend most of your time prototyping, implementing, and validating AI-powered workflows while helping shape technical direction through hands-on engineering. You&#39;ll work at the intersection of developer tools, AI agents, IDE architecture, and product strategy while helping define how software developers work with AI in the future.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Example problems you&#39;ll work on:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1257&quot; data-end=&quot;1772&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1kr8jn4&quot; data-start=&quot;1257&quot; data-end=&quot;1341&quot;&gt;How can coding agents become more effective when working with large C++ codebases?&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1grdqsk&quot; data-start=&quot;1342&quot; data-end=&quot;1472&quot;&gt;How can CLion&#39;s debugging, code understanding, and navigation capabilities be integrated into AI-assisted development workflows?&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1a96z5j&quot; data-start=&quot;1473&quot; data-end=&quot;1584&quot;&gt;How should AI-powered developer experiences be evaluated and benchmarked in real-world development scenarios?&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;x2tg27&quot; data-start=&quot;1585&quot; data-end=&quot;1657&quot;&gt;What capabilities should AI agents have access to inside a modern IDE?&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1h33vb4&quot; data-start=&quot;1658&quot; data-end=&quot;1772&quot;&gt;How can we make CLion a better environment for developers who increasingly collaborate with AI tools and agents?&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this role, you will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;ulv941&quot; data-start=&quot;167&quot; data-end=&quot;285&quot;&gt;Shape and deliver AI-powered features for CLion and C++ development workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;lhgmb6&quot; data-start=&quot;286&quot; data-end=&quot;417&quot;&gt;Design the architecture for AI integrations, agent tools, and C++-specific AI capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;dripig&quot; data-start=&quot;418&quot; data-end=&quot;591&quot;&gt;Build practical benchmarks and evaluation frameworks for AI-assisted C++ development scenarios.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1gmdjb8&quot; data-start=&quot;592&quot; data-end=&quot;750&quot;&gt;Prototype and validate new AI workflows, including debugging, code understanding, refactoring, and project navigation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1qfb96v&quot; data-start=&quot;751&quot; data-end=&quot;923&quot;&gt;Collaborate with product managers, ML engineers, QA engineers, stakeholders, and senior developers to shape and deliver the roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;cg7clz&quot; data-start=&quot;924&quot; data-end=&quot;1109&quot;&gt;Work closely with JetBrains AI, ML, and product teams to help define the AI strategy for the C++ ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1ew61mo&quot; data-start=&quot;1110&quot; data-end=&quot;1273&quot;&gt;Evaluate and prioritize AI initiatives, bringing new ideas and proposals that align with the broader JetBrains AI strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;mf99vh&quot; data-start=&quot;1274&quot; data-end=&quot;1465&quot;&gt;Contribute hands-on to technical design, software architecture, and implementation in a large, mature codebase.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1j853ei&quot; data-start=&quot;1466&quot; data-end=&quot;1604&quot;&gt;Help define a technical roadmap for AI agent and tool integrations in C++ development workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;10l7mut&quot; data-start=&quot;1605&quot; data-end=&quot;1737&quot;&gt;Build trust and alignment across the C++ Ecosystem, AI, Product, QA, and ML organizations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We&#39;d love to talk if you have:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant software engineering experience as a Staff Engineer, Principal Engineer, Technical Lead, or similar senior technical role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience with Kotlin, Java, or other JVM technologies, or the ability to quickly become productive in a JVM-based codebase.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building AI-powered products, developer tools, coding assistants, agents, or LLM-based workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;u914ku&quot; data-start=&quot;4530&quot; data-end=&quot;4665&quot;&gt;Strong understanding of how modern coding agents operate, including tool calling, context management, MCP, and evaluation techniques.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;878m62&quot; data-start=&quot;4755&quot; data-end=&quot;4843&quot;&gt;A track record of driving technical direction in ambiguous and rapidly evolving areas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1lcrl1i&quot; data-start=&quot;4844&quot; data-end=&quot;4932&quot;&gt;Strong product instincts and an ability to balance innovation with practical delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;vtnivs&quot; data-start=&quot;4933&quot; data-end=&quot;5020&quot;&gt;Excellent communication skills and the ability to influence without formal authority.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1342&quot; data-end=&quot;1687&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1b3ujlt&quot; data-start=&quot;1342&quot; data-end=&quot;1462&quot;&gt;Experience with C++ development workflows, compilers, debuggers, language tooling, or developer productivity products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;p2q2va&quot; data-start=&quot;1463&quot; data-end=&quot;1569&quot;&gt;Experience with IDE internals, language servers, code analysis, refactoring systems, or static analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1axscea&quot; data-start=&quot;1570&quot; data-end=&quot;1633&quot;&gt;Experience leading small teams or acting as a technical lead.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;ny4zci&quot; data-start=&quot;1634&quot; data-end=&quot;1687&quot;&gt;Experience working on AI-native developer products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;ctb2ez&quot; data-start=&quot;4418&quot; data-end=&quot;4445&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why this role is unique&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;4781&quot; data-end=&quot;5174&quot;&gt;Rather than building generic chat experiences, you&#39;ll be working on challenges such as AI-assisted debugging, agent-powered code understanding, developer workflow automation, and evaluation systems for AI-powered development tools. Your work will directly influence products used by millions of developers worldwide and help shape JetBrains&#39; broader vision for AI-powered software development.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why join JetBrains?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong base salary. We offer competitive pay that reflects your skills and experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible work location. Enjoy the freedom to work from home or from the office.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remote work. Spend up to 30 days per year working remotely from abroad.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extra time off. More days to relax, recharge, and do the things you love.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Medical insurance allowance. Enjoy peace of mind for you and your family&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learning and development opportunities. Access to conferences, courses, and language classes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Relocation support. We help make your move as smooth and stress-free as possible. (keep if relevant for the role)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Language classes. Pick up the local language or sharpen your English skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fuel your day. Enjoy a hot meal or receive a lunch allowance on workdays.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mental health support. To help you feel your best, we provide easy access to professional mental health services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sports benefit. Enjoy an on-site gym or sports club stipend.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Internal events. Join company-wide celebrations and team gatherings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;*Some benefits may vary depending on location.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;#LI-DNI&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We are an equal opportunity employer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We know great ideas can come from anyone, anywhere. That’s why we do our best to create an open and inclusive workplace – one that welcomes everyone regardless of their background, identity, religion, age, accessibility needs, or orientation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;We process the data provided in your job application in accordance with the&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.jetbrains.com/legal/docs/privacy/privacy-recruitment/&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Our mission&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;bub-content-body&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;field field--name-body field--type-text-with-summary field--label-hidden field__item&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Constructor’s mission is to enable all educational organisations to provide high-quality digital education to 10x people with 10x efficiency.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With strong expertise in machine intelligence and data science, Constructor’s all-in-one platform for education and research addresses today’s pressing educational challenges: access inequality, tech clutter, and low engagement of students.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please send your resume in English only.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Are you passionate about&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;AI, LLMs, software engineering, or applied research&lt;/strong&gt;?&lt;br&gt;Do you want to work alongside industry professionals?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Constructor TECH and Constructor Labs invites you to take part in the &lt;strong&gt;Student Labs&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;— a 2-month program where you will:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solve real-world tech &amp;amp; research challenges;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with other students;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Get mentorship from Constructor Tech and Constructor Labs specialists;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and present a working prototype, report, or research concept.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who can apply?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This opportunity is open to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Constructor University and partner university students,&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Students with&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;a strong interest in AI, LLMs, software engineering&lt;/strong&gt;, or&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;research &amp;amp; development;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;👉 How it works:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Choose the project from a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;curated list of topics&lt;/strong&gt; proposed by our experts;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The tasks are divided into different levels of students: beginners, intermediate, and advanced. So, any student can find appropriate project for himself;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Based on project requirements you can apply in pairs and solo;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work independently with&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;regular guidance from a Constructor TECH/Constructor Labs mentor.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why join?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Get&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;mentorship&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;from tech &amp;amp; research professionals;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;project portfolio&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;that matters;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;fast-tracked to paid internship opportunities&lt;/strong&gt; with Constructor ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; 📅 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Labs Duration:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; 2-4 months&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; 📍 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Format:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; Hybrid (for students in Bremen) / Remote + Mentor Check-ins every week&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer For Interns:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Internship Duration: from 2 months or more&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Type of internship:&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;100% remote&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;or hybrid&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;in the office in Bremen (GER), Sofia (BG), Belgrade (SRB), Istanbul (TR), Sakarya (TR), Singapore (SGD)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;The information below only applies to our full-time positions; it does not apply to internships or Student Labs.&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;199&quot; data-end=&quot;1027&quot;&gt;💻 Choice of work equipment (e.g., laptop, monitor, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;199&quot; data-end=&quot;1027&quot;&gt;🇬🇧 English classes (iTalki – $130 monthly)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;199&quot; data-end=&quot;1027&quot;&gt;⏰ Flexible schedule (we usually work between 09:00/10:00 and 18:00/19:00)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;199&quot; data-end=&quot;1027&quot;&gt;👶 Newborn bonus (€500 per child)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;199&quot; data-end=&quot;1027&quot;&gt;🧠 Patent remuneration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;199&quot; data-end=&quot;1027&quot;&gt;🌴 Paid leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;199&quot; data-end=&quot;1027&quot;&gt;🧑‍💻 Remote work in locations without our offices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;199&quot; data-end=&quot;1027&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid work in locations with offices (2 days in-office, 3 days remote)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Constructor&lt;/strong&gt; fosters equal opportunity for people of all backgrounds and identities. We are led by a gender-balanced board committed to building a diverse and inclusive organisation where everyone can become their best self. We do not discriminate based on age, disability, gender identity, sexual orientation, ethnicity, race, religion or belief, parental and family status, or other protected characteristics. We welcome applications from women, men and non-binary candidates of all ethnicities and socio-economic backgrounds. We encourage people belonging to underrepresented groups to apply.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a post-production manager in the HelloFresh Studio, you are a part of our post-production team, working daily on our food and lifestyle imagery. Your expertise in retouching, primarily in Photoshop, plays a crucial role in delivering consistent, appealing, high-quality, yet natural-looking imagery to our stakeholders. You have a good eye for detail and take pride in your work, yet appreciate constructive feedback, prioritize tasks efficiently and have a strong sense of time management. Communicating with various stakeholders and handling photography assets with care and structure. You are not only executing within established workflows, but confidently working with generative AI and hybrid approaches to enhance outputs, increase efficiency, and support new ways of creating visual content.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are up to date with the most important image creation and retouching developments, including generative AI tools, and know how to apply them in a practical, production-ready context.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Editing and retouching&lt;/strong&gt; of our food, product and lifestyle photography&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Handling and fulfilling retouching requests&lt;/strong&gt; within a global and multi-stakeholder environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborate &lt;/strong&gt;with internal teams, ensuring &lt;strong&gt;clear and effective communication&lt;/strong&gt; with stakeholders worldwide, while managing &lt;strong&gt;feedback &lt;/strong&gt;professionally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Maintaining an organized workflow&lt;/strong&gt; and file management standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ensuring&lt;/strong&gt; a consistent look according to our guidelines through all of your work and be a real brand ambassador&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Manage retouch projects&lt;/strong&gt;, including clear and professional stakeholder communication&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Independently use &lt;strong&gt;generative AI tools&lt;/strong&gt; within post-production workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Review and refine&lt;/strong&gt; AI-refined or generated imagery to ensure it meets high-quality, natural-looking, and brand-consistent standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of professional experience in retouching in a commercial setting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;True foodie who enjoys working with food imagery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong expertise in Adobe Photoshop and staying up to date with industry and technology trends. Capture One and/or Lightroom are a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with generative AI image tools and workflows (prompting, iteration, refinement, or node based workflows)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong visual judgment and ability to bring both traditionally shot and AI-assisted imagery to a consistent, high-end commercial quality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;True team player attitude excited about working in a creative and efficient environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent verbal and written communication skills in English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keen eye for detail and meticulous in consistency of outputs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thorough with administrative tasks and have a structured approach to work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pragmatic mindset, always looking for ways to improve and optimize routine tasks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please include a portfolio of your recent and relevant work.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Are you passionate about driving customer growth through smart, data-driven CRM? As the Senior CRM Manager for Referrals, you will play a critical role in scaling HelloFresh Group&#39;s Referral program - one of our highest-ROI acquisition channels - across our global brand portfolio.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your mission: make sure every HelloFresh Group brand benefits from the best referral journeys we build. This role goes beyond executing campaigns. You will design E2E customer journeys across Email, Push, and in-product touchpoints; build segmented communication strategies that turn happy customers into active referrers; and contribute directly to the CRM strategy for our global RAF program - helping shape how we reach and activate customers across 16 countries.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work closely with CRM Operations, Product, Analytics, Pricing &amp;amp; Discounting and Creative - and you will lead the way in applying AI-driven solutions to make the referral CRM pipeline faster, smarter, and more scalable.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Above all, we are looking for people who will &lt;strong&gt;make HelloFresh&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;better.&lt;/strong&gt; We believe there are many different ways of developing skills and we love diverse experiences! So even if you don’t “tick all the boxes” but think you’d thrive in this role, we would really like to learn more about you.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design and own E2E referral customer journeys&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer Journey Ownership: &lt;/strong&gt;Design and execute end-to-end referral journeys - from first invite trigger to friend conversion - across Email, Push Notifications, and in-product touchpoints. Build journeys that feel personal, timely, and brand-right for each market. Benchmark against market best practices in referral, CRM, and lifecycle marketing - and proactively bring new ideas into the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Segmentation: &lt;/strong&gt;Develop segmentation strategies to target the right customers with the right referral message at the right moment. Use behavioural, lifecycle, and value-based signals to identify high-potential referrers across the brand portfolio.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication Strategy: &lt;/strong&gt;Define channel mix, message timing, and creative direction for each brand and segment. Own the full campaign lifecycle - briefing, setup, QA and post-campaign analysis - with high precision and independence. Bring a strong creative perspective to referral communications: develop messaging concepts and campaign ideas that stand out and drive action.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Localisation: &lt;/strong&gt;Coordinate with local market teams and brand managers to ensure campaigns are culturally relevant, on-brand, and timed to local moments and seasonality. Partner with Creative teams to brief and develop assets that land effectively across different brands and markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive performance through data and automation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Performance Optimisation: &lt;/strong&gt;Monitor key metrics (open rate, CTR, conversion rate, referral invite rate, CVA) regularly, identify gaps, and act on them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A/B Testing: &lt;/strong&gt;Design and execute A/B testing strategies to refine messaging, timing, offer framing, and channel mix - continuously improving referral performance across the portfolio.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use self-serve analytics tools and Iterable reporting to produce campaign readouts and share actionable insights with the wider team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the adoption of AI tools for campaign creation, personalisation, and automation - finding ways to work smarter without sacrificing quality or brand relevance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CRM Craft: &lt;/strong&gt;3-5 years of hands-on experience in CRM, lifecycle marketing, or email marketing. Hands-on experience building and deploying campaigns across multiple CRM channels. Iterable experience is a strong plus; familiarity with Braze, Klaviyo, or Salesforce Marketing Cloud also valued.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data-Driven Mindset: &lt;/strong&gt;Comfortable reading performance dashboards, running analyses, and drawing actionable conclusions from campaign data. You know what the numbers mean and what to do about them - without needing to be a data scientist.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Creative Instinct: &lt;/strong&gt;A genuinely creative perspective on CRM — you have opinions on what makes great referral communications, follow the industry, and bring fresh thinking to briefs rather than recycling templates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI &amp;amp; Automation Curiosity: &lt;/strong&gt;Familiarity with or strong interest in AI tools for marketing: prompt-based content creation, personalisation at scale, campaign automation — and a drive to push these capabilities further.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaboration: &lt;/strong&gt;Strong communicator, used to working across Creative, Analytics, Operations, and local teams. You can translate strategy into clear recommendations for any level of stakeholder.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Degree in marketing, business, communications, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with referral or virality programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background working across multiple brands or in a multi-market / regional CRM role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Compensation &amp;amp; Financial Wellbeing&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’ll receive a competitive salary package, including a HelloFresh-subsidized pension scheme.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy savings on your weekly HelloFresh box.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Save with discount schemes with corporate benefits and Vorteile.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Health &amp;amp; Wellbeing&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support your mental wellbeing with access to platforms like Headspace and Spill.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay active with 24/7 office gym access, a discounted Urban Sports Club membership, and other wellbeing resources.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Flexibility &amp;amp; Work-Life&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Balance your life with our flexible hybrid model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recharge with sabbatical leave options in addition to standard time off.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Get to work with ease through sustainable travel perks and transportation benefits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Career &amp;amp; Development&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embrace &quot;Learning Never Stops&quot; with internal training, the HelloFresh Academy, and a dedicated budget for German language courses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Culture &amp;amp; Environment&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy tasty in-office meal deals and fresh food options.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We support working families with parent-friendly policies, an in-office kids corner, and an on-site babysitter.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Are you up for the challenge?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Please submit your complete application below including your salary expectations and earliest starting date.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;After submitting an application our team will review this and get back to you within 5 business days.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;Factor_, a HelloFresh brand, is looking for you as an Operational Excellence Lead (m/f/d). As Operational Excellence Lead, you will lead the OpEx team at our food production site and drive the continuous improvement of our production and business processes. With a strong focus on efficiency, quality, and sustainability, you’ll apply Lean and WCM methodologies to deliver measurable improvements — both strategically and operationally.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive impactful Operational Excellence initiatives&lt;/strong&gt; across the site, identifying opportunities to improve efficiency, quality, productivity, and cost&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead cross-functional improvement projects from idea to implementation&lt;/strong&gt;, using Lean Six Sigma and structured problem-solving to deliver sustainable results&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner with teams across Production, Quality, Engineering, and Supply Chain&lt;/strong&gt; to challenge existing processes, develop solutions, and turn improvement opportunities into action&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Use data and operational insights to identify root causes, track performance, and make improvement opportunities visible&lt;/strong&gt;, supporting fact-based decision-making&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Act as a trusted Operational Excellence expert and sparring partner&lt;/strong&gt; for operational teams and senior stakeholders, bringing new ideas and best practices to the organisation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build and scale a culture of continuous improvement&lt;/strong&gt; by facilitating workshops, sharing knowledge, and enabling teams to solve problems effectively and sustainably&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own and shape your improvement agenda&lt;/strong&gt;, balancing strategic projects with emerging opportunities in a dynamic, fast-paced production environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A university degree in Engineering, Operations Management, or a related discipline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in Operational Excellence, Continuous Improvement, Process Engineering, or a similar role, ideally within a manufacturing or food production environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience driving cross-functional improvement projects and turning ideas into sustainable, measurable results&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of Lean Six Sigma methodologies and structured problem-solving; Green Belt certification is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and stakeholder management skills, with the ability to use data to influence decisions and drive change across teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in German and English, with a proactive, hands-on mindset and a passion for continuous improvement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why you&#39;ll love it here:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Growth &amp;amp; Development: Internal training opportunities plus a yearly Learning &amp;amp; Development budget.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Food &amp;amp; Lifestyle: Discounts on Factor_-boxes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Compensation: Competitive salary and 30 days of vacation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health &amp;amp; Well-being: Access to well-being initiatives, with discounted fitness offers currently being rolled out.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Future Benefits: We’re working on introducing additional perks, including mobility support and a company pension scheme, to give our team even more flexibility and security.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Hungry for More?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Apply now with your complete application documents. We welcome applications without a photo and without information regarding nationality, gender, or other personal characteristics. You are also welcome to include language certificates and documentation confirming your right to live and work in the respective country.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We look forward to getting to know you!&lt;/p&gt;
