&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;WPP steht für kreative Transformation. Mit der Kraft von Kreativität gestalten wir eine bessere Zukunft für unsere Mitarbeitenden, unsere Kunden, unsere Gemeinschaften und unseren Planeten. Genau hier setzt WPP Media an: Als globales Mediennetzwerk von WPP vereinen wir die besten Plattformen, Talente und Partner, um in einer vernetzten Medienwelt neue Chancen für grenzenloses Wachstum zu schaffen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Das bieten wir dir:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work-Life-Balance&lt;/strong&gt;: Dank flexibler Arbeitszeiten mit Schwerpunkt auf dem persönlichen Austausch im Office und ergänzender Remote Work passt sich dein Job deinem Leben an. Überstunden kannst du flexible ausgleichen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vacation mode on&lt;/strong&gt;: Du erhältst 18 Urlaubstage plus einen flexiblen Tag – zusätzlich sind der 24. und 31.12. frei.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wellbeing first:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Gesundheitsleistungen, attraktive Altersvorsorge sowie Mental Health Awareness Days stellen deine Gesundheit in den Mittelpunkt.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Practice makes perfect&lt;/strong&gt;: Entfalte dich mit unseren vielfältigen Weiterbildungen und nutze unsere internen Karriereprogramme für deine Entwicklung im WPP-Netzwerk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;More than just a job&lt;/strong&gt;: Dich erwarten unvergessliche Events, Mitarbeitendenrabatte und weitere Highlights wie das Job Ticket, Wellhub oder das Job Bike.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Be yourself&lt;/strong&gt;: Bei uns ist jede:r herzlich willkommen - Vielfalt und Chancengleichheit liegen uns am Herzen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Das bewegst du:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Als &lt;strong&gt;Werkstudent (Mensch) Media Audit &amp;amp; Value Management&lt;/strong&gt; unterstützt du uns im operativen Tagesgeschäft dabei, die Mediainvestitionen unserer Kunden transparent und nachvollziehbar abzubilden. Du arbeitest mit den Daten der Werbeschaltungen und sorgst dafür, dass Budgets, Buchungen und KPIs korrekt erfasst und geprüft werden.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualitätssicherung:&lt;/strong&gt; Rohdaten zu den Werbeschaltungen werden in Excel aufbereitet und auf Vollständigkeit, Richtigkeit und Plausibilität geprüft.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Media Audits:&lt;/strong&gt; Bei der Erstellung und Pflege unserer Audit-Templates unterstützt du sowohl unterjährig als auch zum Jahresabschluss. Dabei werden Werbeschaltungen und Mediainvestitionen systematisch erfasst und aufbereitet.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reporting &amp;amp; Datenanalyse:&lt;/strong&gt; Die Analyse relevanter Daten und KPIs hilft dabei, Abweichungen zu erkennen und die Ergebnisse als Grundlage für weitere Auswertungen und Entscheidungen aufzubereiten.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Teamwork &amp;amp; Schnittstellen:&lt;/strong&gt; In enger Zusammenarbeit mit verschiedenen internen Teams und Stakeholdern sorgst du dafür, dass Informationen und Daten korrekt zusammengeführt werden.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Das zeichnet dich aus:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Studium &amp;amp; Verfügbarkeit:&lt;/strong&gt; Als eingeschriebene/r Student/in studierst du vorzugsweise Medienmanagement, BWL, Wirtschaftsinformatik oder einen vergleichbaren Studiengang und möchtest uns mindestens 1,5 Jahre mit 15 bis 20 Stunden pro Woche unterstützen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytisches Verständnis:&lt;/strong&gt; Deine Begeisterung für Zahlen und Daten sowie dein ausgeprägtes analytisches Verständnis zeichnen dich aus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;MS Excel &amp;amp; Arbeitsweise:&lt;/strong&gt; Gute, praxiserprobte MS-Excel-Kenntnisse, eine strukturierte und gewissenhafte Arbeitsweise sowie Eigenverantwortlichkeit gehören zu deinen Stärken.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hands-On &amp;amp; Kommunikation:&lt;/strong&gt; Eine pragmatische Hands-On-Mentalität und sichere Kommunikation auf Deutsch und Englisch runden dein Profil ab.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Darüber hinaus bist du:&lt;strong&gt; #AnalytischesDenken #HandsOnMentalität #Teamwork&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Wenn du diesen Job spannend findest, dann ermutigen wir dich ausdrücklich zur Bewerbung, auch wenn du nicht jede oben gelistete Qualifikation aufweisen kannst.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Arbeiten bei WPP Media:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Als WPP Media gestalten wir die Zukunft der Medien und investieren dabei konsequent in unsere Mitarbeiter:innen. Jede:r Kolleg:in genießt die Vorteile des globalen Netzwerks von WPP Media und WPP, um sich weiterzuentwickeln&amp;nbsp;und an der Spitze von Marketing und Werbung zu lernen. Vielfalt und Zusammenhalt leben wir durch zahlreiche Employee Resource Groups und regelmäßige interne Events - zum Austausch, zur Inspiration und zum gemeinsamen Feiern unserer Erfolge.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;WPP Media ist ein Arbeitgeber, der Chancengleichheit fördert. Wir berücksichtigen alle Bewerber:innen für alle Positionen ohne Diskriminierung. Unser Ziel ist eine Kultur des Respekts und der Zugehörigkeit, in der jede:r die gleichen Möglichkeiten hat, sich einzubringen und beruflich zu wachsen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bitte lies unsere &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;Datenschutzerklärung&lt;/a&gt; für Deutschland, Österreich und die Schweiz, um weitere Informationen darüber zu erhalten, wie wir die von dir bereitgestellten Daten verarbeiten.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Software Engineer &lt;/strong&gt;to join the AI Platform Team at Smartly! Our team works on helping marketers make the most of their ad creatives (images, video, text) and campaigns (product and performance data). We build and experiment with AI-based solutions across the media and creative workflows.You will have the opportunity to take ownership of and work on high impact projects.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join us in building high impact ML-based solutions to help our customers to build better and more effective advertising experiences for their consumers. If you’re a growth minded individual who has a passion for ML and the marketing space, this team is for you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We use Python, TypeScript, PostgreSQL, Node.js, Docker and Kubernetes for our microservices, TypeScript and React in the frontend of our products.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Here&#39;s What You&#39;ll Do...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, build and maintain backend services that sit at the core of Smartly.io’s campaign optimization products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be a core contributor of our team and our ways of working to build high impact products. You’ll actively be involved in work planning, retrospectives, and overall team improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support data scientists in bringing machine learning models to production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor your team on software development practices and propagate best practices like testing, monitoring, or clean code.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use your skills and experience to continuously improve our software architecture, coding practices, tools, and processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with our stakeholders - be them product, engineering, infrastructure - to ensure we meet customers where they are. Being able to translate business/product needs to viable solutions is a must.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply and enhance your soft skills through working closely with your colleagues and our customers. Doing knowledge shares, running productive meetings, and pair programming/debugging are just some ways we grow our soft skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Impact the daily life of the staff of the hundreds of advertisers using Smartly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Here&#39;s What We&#39;re Looking For...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We’re seeking an experienced Software Engineer with Strong Python skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience developing and deploying production-quality software&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years of experience working with cloud infrastructure such as AWS or GCP&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with NodeJS, React, TypeScript is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with modern ML frameworks (e.g., PyTorch, TensorFlow) is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of MLOps concepts and tools (e.g., MLflow, Kubeflow) is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing and maintaining services under SLA&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analytical mindset with a problem-solving approach&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for solving customer challenges quickly while making thoughtful architectural decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adaptability and resilience when facing new or ambiguous challenges&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal communication skills in English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work 3 days / week at our office&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;M.Sc. in a relevant field is preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer You...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Inclusive Culture: Join a team of over 750 Smartlies representing more than 60 nationalities across 24 locations in 13 countries, we foster a culture built on trust, transparency, and open feedback.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Global Impact: Be part of a company making a global impact, directly influencing our customers and business growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Wellbeing Focus: Enjoy generous healthcare packages, mental health services, and a healthy work-life balance with paid holidays and family leave.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Total Rewards: Benefit from equity options, performance-based rewards, competitive compensation, and ample career development opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hybrid Workplace: Experience the flexibility of a hybrid work model, balancing office and remote work, with the option to work abroad for up to 30 days.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Smartly is committed to being the best place to work for growth-minded individuals to thrive. Explore more in our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://assets.website-files.com/63d671dfba7daa79b745ce98/658068a97117b92f5dde8b02_Culture%20Handbook_181223.pdf&quot;&gt;Culture Handbook&lt;/a&gt;!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-hybrid #LI-JF2&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Smartly&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Smartly is the AI-powered advertising technology company transforming ad experiences for brands and their consumers. Our comprehensive advertising platform seamlessly integrates the capabilities of media, creative, and intelligence to power more than 800 billion impressions and generate more than 300 billion creatives annually, delivering tangible business outcomes for brands and advertisers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Smartly is the only company in the industry recognized as a Leader in The Forrester Wave: Creative Advertising Technologies with PwC validating the results it delivers for brands. We manage creative and media for 700+ brands worldwide and $6B in ad spend across the largest media platforms, including Facebook, Google, Instagram, Pinterest, Snap, and TikTok. Our end-to-end technology, unmatched access to media platforms and exceptional customer service help Fortune 500 brands to reach and engage consumers and learn what performs best.Smartly is a multinational and diverse team of 750+ Smartlies from 60+ nationalities, working in 13 countries. Together, we want to create and maintain an inclusive environment where everyone feels respected and heard. Our Diversity, Equity &amp;amp; Inclusion approach is at the heart of it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Visit &lt;a class=&quot;c-link c-link--underline&quot; href=&quot;http://smartly.io/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;http://Smartly.io&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Smartly&lt;/a&gt; to learn more.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The processing of your information is described in our &lt;a href=&quot;https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67ed4ab7f914accf87aa070c/698a11cb716926c1d76c1641_Smartly.io%20Group%20-%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Candidates%20-%201_2026.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a&lt;strong&gt; Senior Engineering Manager&lt;/strong&gt; to join our 200+ product development organization and lead our&lt;strong&gt; Ad Performance Recommendation team&lt;/strong&gt;. The team is responsible for developing an innovative AI-powered system that leverages marketing ad tech data and various data sources to identify performance signals and generate actionable recommendations for digital advertisers and marketers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As part of the AI Platform organization, you will lead a multidisciplinary team of Data Scientists, ML Engineers, and Software Engineers working to accelerate AI adoption and development across Smartly’s Media, Creative, and Intelligence suite. The team ensures compliance with privacy, security, and ethical guidelines.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is an opportunity to define the vision and strategy for ML and Data Science applications, drive execution on ambitious goals, and champion AI and ML excellence throughout Smartly.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Smartly is proud to be ranked as a leader in The Forrester Wave™ for Creative AdTech. This recognition reflects our commitment to transforming ad experiences through intelligent creativity, standing as the only platform honored by both Forrester and validated by PwC to be recognized for ad technology to power performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To get an idea of some of the work we do, see for example these blog posts:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.smartly.io/blog/tutorial-how-we-productized-bayesian-revenue-estimation-with-stan&quot;&gt;How We Productized Bayesian Revenue Estimation with Stan&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.smartly.io/blog/optimizing-conversions-with-predictive-budget-allocation&quot;&gt;Optimizing Conversions with Predictive Budget Allocation&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Here’s What You&#39;ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and grow the Ad Performance Recommendation team, providing technical direction, strategic vision, and hands-on leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive the development of AdTech-specific ML models foundational AI capabilities (e.g. predictive and simulation techniques) and explore novel approaches that can be applied across Smartly’s products. Optimize existing models for performance, efficiency, and scalability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate cross-functionally with other teams to ensure AI-driven features deliver measurable business and customer impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure compliance with privacy, security, and ethical AI standards in ML applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foster a strong engineering culture focused on innovation, quality, and continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor team members through coaching, 1:1s, and career development plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remove obstacles to enable your team to thrive and deliver exceptional results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with recruiting to help scale the team by actively sourcing and closing the best talent.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with other leaders in the AI Platform to shape Smartly’s long-term AI strategy and architecture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Here&#39;s What We&#39;re Looking For…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of experience in building services and products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in applying machine learning to real-life problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience in leading teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competent with key technologies in ML; PyTorch, TensorFlow, Python, SQL.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to mentor, coach, and develop data scientists and machine learning engineers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience in delivering scalable ML systems in production. You will need to be hands-on when coaching the team members to new technical and professional heights, which can involve code reviews, pair programming, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A pragmatic mindset. We always aim to create value to our customers. We&#39;re also working on production systems and our customers&#39; business depends on it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curiosity and the drive to continuously learn through study and experimentation on the job.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to drive both technical excellence and cross-functional collaboration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of security and compliance requirements when working with personal data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;M.Sc. or Ph.D. in a relevant field (Mathematics, CS, AI, Physics, …).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills, written and spoken English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work 3 days / week at our office&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer you…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ownership Culture: Make a significant impact on our products with autonomy and ownership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Industry Collaboration: Collaborate with leading online marketers and platforms like Meta, Pinterest, Snap, TikTok, and Google.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional Development: Access opportunities for growth through mentorship, training, and resources to enhance your skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Wellbeing Focus: Prioritize your health with comprehensive healthcare packages and mental health services, plus a healthy work-life balance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Total Rewards: Everyone at Smartly is an owner with our equity options program and performance-based grants. We recognize success with compensation, benefits, and career development opportunities.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We work in a flexible hybrid work model, including the option to work abroad for up to 30 days.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Smartly is committed to being the best place to work for growth-minded individuals to thrive - explore more in our &lt;a href=&quot;https://assets.website-files.com/63d671dfba7daa79b745ce98/658068a97117b92f5dde8b02_Culture%20Handbook_181223.pdf&quot;&gt;Culture Handbook&lt;/a&gt;!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What to Expect from Our Recruitment Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meet your Recruiter: Get to know each other and learn about working at Smartly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meet the Team Manager: Gain deeper insights into your future team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meet the Team in Subject Matter Interviews: Engage in a case study and showcase your domain knowledge.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meet the Leadership in a Final Meeting: A brief discussion with our Chief Technical Officer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Apply now and shape the future of digital advertising!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Smartly&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Smartly is the AI-powered advertising technology company transforming ad experiences for brands and their consumers. Our comprehensive advertising platform seamlessly integrates the capabilities of media, creative, and intelligence to power more than 800 billion impressions and generate more than 300 billion creatives annually, delivering tangible business outcomes for brands and advertisers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Smartly is the only company in the industry recognized as a Leader in The Forrester Wave: Creative Advertising Technologies with PwC validating the results it delivers for brands. We manage creative and media for 700+ brands worldwide and $6B in ad spend across the largest media platforms, including Facebook, Google, Instagram, Pinterest, Snap, and TikTok. Our end-to-end technology, unmatched access to media platforms and exceptional customer service help Fortune 500 brands to reach and engage consumers and learn what performs best.Smartly is a multinational and diverse team of 750+ Smartlies from 60+ nationalities, working in 13 countries. Together, we want to create and maintain an inclusive environment where everyone feels respected and heard. Our Diversity, Equity &amp;amp; Inclusion approach is at the heart of it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Visit &lt;a class=&quot;c-link c-link--underline&quot; href=&quot;http://smartly.io/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;http://Smartly.io&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Smartly&lt;/a&gt; to learn more.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The processing of your information is described in our &lt;a href=&quot;https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67ed4ab7f914accf87aa070c/698a11cb716926c1d76c1641_Smartly.io%20Group%20-%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Candidates%20-%201_2026.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Unframe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Unframe is an AI-first startup helping the world’s largest enterprises bring LLM-powered applications to life in days - not months. We combine the speed of a product company with the flexibility of a consultancy, helping customers move from idea to deployed AI systems faster than anyone else in the market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With over $100M in TCV secured within 12 months, and a $50M Series B led by Highland Europe, Unframe is rapidly scaling globally alongside Fortune 500 customers, backed by Bessemer, Craft, and TLV.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a AI Transformation Architect at Unframe, you’ll be the first technical voice a prospect hears. You’ll join early conversations, showcase real solutions built on Unframe, and help potential customers connect the dots between their needs and our platform. You’ll demo AI-powered use cases across multiple industries - from finance to cybersecurity to operations - and guide technical discovery to help prospects envision what’s possible.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a high-impact, outward-facing role at the intersection of Sales, Product and Marketing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Join early-stage calls with Strategic Account Executives to lead technical discovery and demos.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver compelling live demos tailored to customer pain points and use cases.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate customer pain points into relevant AI-powered solution examples.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate the value and architecture of Unframe clearly and confidently.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build credibility and trust with prospects while becoming a strategic partner in shaping their AI vision.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Share insights with Product, Marketing, and R&amp;amp;D teams based on real-world conversations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we are looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years experience in solutions engineering, technical pre-sales, or product management.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of enterprise software, APIs, and modern cloud platforms.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confident presenting technical products to both business and technical audiences.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent verbal and written communication skills in both, &lt;strong&gt;English and German.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curious, collaborative, and customer-obsessed — you know how to ask the right questions and build strong relationships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why join us?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;You’ll help some of the world’s leading companies understand and adopt AI in real, practical ways. You’ll work directly with enterprise customers, lead meaningful technical conversations, and help shape how our platform is experienced in the market. You’ll have real ownership, work closely with Product, Sales, and R&amp;amp;D, and play a key role in building what comes next in one of the fastest-moving spaces in tech.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Everpure (NYSE: P) has evolved from storage pioneer to data platform, closing fiscal 2026 with $3.7 billion in revenue, its first billion-dollar quarter, and accelerating growth into FY27. Our strategic agenda spans the companies defining the next era of technology - hyperscalers, AI labs, the AI hardware supply chain, data platform providers, and the broader AI ecosystem.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This type of work—work that changes the world—is what the tech industry was founded on. So, if you&#39;re ready to seize the endless opportunities and leave your mark, come join us.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE ROLE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Healthcare &amp;amp; Life Sciences Principal, Business Development (EMEA), you will partner with EMEA Sales and Sales Engineering leaders to shape and execute the region’s HLS growth strategy. You will connect market opportunity to field execution: prioritizing segments and accounts, developing repeatable vertical and horizontal plays, strengthening the organization and partner ecosystem, and leading critical customer and alliance initiatives. You will be expected to operate comfortably at three levels:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;● Strategic: Define where and how Everpure should win in European healthcare and life sciences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;● Organizational: Build the capabilities, coverage, relationships, and operating cadence required to scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;● Commercial: Personally advance priority opportunities, alliances, and executive relationships to closed business and measurable customer value.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The role requires a combination of HLS credibility, technical fluency in data and AI platforms, commercial ownership, and the ability to influence across country sales, SE, partners, and corporate teams without relying on formal authority.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU&#39;LL DO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the Pipeline &amp;amp; Financial Performance:&lt;/strong&gt; Own the booking targets and financial performance for the segment by developing and executing a multi year strategic growth plan. Drive and scale the overarching pipeline and bookings targets across the EMEA ecosystem, establishing clear qualification criteria and pipeline visibility.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Define the EMEA Value Proposition:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Define and articulate the value proposition for Healthcare &amp;amp; Life Sciences to drive growth and establish Everpure as the industry leader.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Architect &amp;amp; Execute Joint GTM Plans:&lt;/strong&gt; Author and launch strategic go-to-market plans with priority partners, aligning internal cross-functional EMEA teams (Partner Account Teams, Core Sales, Alliances, Marketing) to unlock high-potential HLS customer accounts and activate new revenue streams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Orchestrate Strategic Alliances:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Orchestrate strategic vertical alliances and operationalize relationships with key partners to secure reference architectures and joint go to market motions.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enable and Mobilize the Partner Ecosystem:&lt;/strong&gt; Equip sales teams and partners with the specialized tools, training, and playbooks they need to successfully position and sell vertical solutions. Train and align Partner representatives ensuring they can effectively articulate our value proposition, economic differentiation, and technical sizing for healthcare compliance.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Joint Demand Gen &amp;amp; Thought Leadership:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Act as a spokesperson for your vertical vision in customer meetings, industry events, analyst briefings, and media opportunities. Build credibility as a principal advisor by shaping the industry narrative around intelligent data foundations and enterprise AI adoption.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU BRING&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;HLS &amp;amp; Alliance Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven success leading strategic business development or alliance management within the technology sector, with a deep understanding of customers solutions, cloud economics, and the specific regulatory, data, and compliance needs of the EMEA Healthcare and Life Sciences sector.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Influence &amp;amp; Execution:&lt;/strong&gt; Develop and execute the global strategy for your segment in partnership with Product Management, Sales, and Engineering teams. A track record of balancing high-level strategy with a &quot;roll-up-your-sleeves&quot; execution mindset, showing a strong ability to build trust and influence executive leaders across partner organizations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agile Collaboration &amp;amp; Communication:&lt;/strong&gt; Outstanding business acumen and communication skills, with a collaborative approach to thriving in a fast-paced, cross-functional, and multi-cultural EMEA environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location &amp;amp; Travel:&lt;/strong&gt; We operate in a hybrid/field-based model. You will be expected to work effectively from a regional corporate office in a key EMEA market, with the ability to travel 25–40% across the region as business needs require.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU CAN EXPECT FROM US:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Innovation&lt;/strong&gt;: We celebrate those who think critically, like a challenge, and aspire to be trailblazers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth&lt;/strong&gt;: We give you the space and support to grow along with us and to contribute to something meaningful. We have been named Fortune&#39;s Best Workplaces in Technology™, Fortune&#39;s Best Workplaces in the Bay Area™, and certified as a Great Place to Work®!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team&lt;/strong&gt;: We build each other up and set aside ego for the greater good.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;And because we understand the value of bringing your full and best self to work, we offer a variety of perks to manage a healthy balance, including flexible time off, wellness resources, and company-sponsored team events. Check out &lt;a href=&quot;http://benefits.everpuredata.com/&quot;&gt;http://benefits.everpuredata.com/ &lt;/a&gt;for more information.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ACCOMMODATIONS AND ACCESSIBILITY:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Candidates with disabilities may request accommodations for all aspects of our hiring process. For more on this, contact us at &lt;a ---------- if you’re invited to an interview.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;OUR COMMITMENT TO A STRONG AND INCLUSIVE TEAM:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re forging a future where everyone finds their rightful place and where every voice matters. Where uniqueness isn’t just accepted but embraced. That’s why we are committed to fostering the growth and development of every person, cultivating a sense of community through our Employee Resource Groups and advocating for inclusive leadership.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Everpure is proud to be an equal opportunity employer. We do not discriminate based upon race, religion, color, national origin, sex (including pregnancy, childbirth, or related medical conditions), sexual orientation, gender, gender identity, gender expression, transgender status, sexual stereotypes, age, status as a protected veteran, status as an individual with a disability, or any other characteristic legally protected by the laws of the jurisdiction in which you are being considered for hire.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us and bring your best.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bring your bold.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pure and simple.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Recruitment Fraud Alert&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’ve learned that scammers are impersonating Commvault team members—including HR and leadership—via email or text. These bad actors may conduct fake interviews and ask for personal information, such as your social security number. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What to know:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commvault does&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;not&lt;/em&gt;&amp;nbsp;conduct interviews by email or text.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We will never ask you to submit sensitive documents (including banking information, SSN, etc) before your first day.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commvault recruiters may contact prospective candidates through LinkedIn and other professional networking platforms regarding career opportunities. If you are unsure whether a recruiting communication is legitimate, review the profile to ensure they have a badge verifying them as a Commvault employee.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you suspect a recruiting scam, please contact us at &lt;u&gt;&lt;a ----------
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Commvault&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Commvault (NASDAQ: CVLT) is the gold standard in cyber resilience. The company empowers customers to uncover, take action, and rapidly recover from cyberattacks – keeping data safe and businesses resilient. The company’s unique AI-powered platform combines best-in-class data protection, exceptional data security, advanced data intelligence, and lightning-fast recovery across any workload or cloud at the lowest TCO. For over 25 years, more than 100,000 organizations and a vast partner ecosystem have relied on Commvault to reduce risks, improve governance, and do more with data.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;The Channel Sales Engineer is responsible for providing pre-sales technical / functional support to channel sales teams and the partner eco-system in their region. They have a focus on securing end user license revenue whilst maintaining high levels of partner contact and awareness through technical support and enablement&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We require a highly technical person with outstanding commercial skills to join our team. Do you have the ability to collaborate closely with partners in order to successfully position our value above and beyond the competition?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with the regional Pre-Sales team reporting to Channel Pre-Sales Leader&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Present and demonstrate the Commvault software suite of products through the use of appropriate media – presentation, white board and demonstrations, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with internal departments (sales, support, marketing, channel), as appropriate, to ensure success during sales campaigns and/or to ensure the partner experience is positive&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist in achieving annual revenue goals in line with the Commvault’s regional business plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Attend meetings, training and maintain regular communication with the regional / global Pre-Sales community and other technical and development functions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be an inspiration leader within the Pre-Sales division and a go-to resource&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven knowledge and experience within Software / SaaS industry in a similar capacity. Ideally within Data Management / Security and Cyber Resiliency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Wide range of technical knowledge of data management inclusive of applications, cloud, compliance, disaster recovery, tape infrastructure, storage arrays, storage networking, networking protocols, and general connectivity in multi-platform enterprise environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A dynamic, fast paced individual who is motivated by success and takes the responsibility of owning issues to resolution. Understands the true meaning of “ownership” and “will do”&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional internal and client centric interpersonal skills in a commercial situation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shown success in taking care of Enterprise clients and working on high level deals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience of working on sophisticated RFPs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competence with prioritising work and balancing workloads&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent German &amp;amp; English verbal and written language skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-SK1&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-HYBRID&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;jd-info au-target&quot; data-ph-at-id=&quot;jobdescription-text&quot; data-ph-id=&quot;ph-page-element-page5-4e8TMw&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Commvault is an equal opportunity workplace and is an affirmative action employer. We are always committed to equal employment opportunity regardless of race, color, ancestry, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship, marital status, disability, gender identity or Veteran status and we will not discriminate against on the basis of such characteristics or any other status protected by the laws or regulations in the locations where we work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Commvault’s goal is to make interviewing inclusive and accessible to all candidates and employees. If you have a disability or special need that requires accommodation to participate in the interview process or apply for a position at Commvault, please email &lt;a ----- target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;span ----- any inquiries not related to an accommodation please reach out to&amp;nbsp;&lt;a ----- target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;span -----
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.commvault.com/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;Commvault&#39;s Privacy Policy &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
